(17, '2010-04-03', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. Elaine D. Sembrano', '2nd Indorsement dated 03 March 2010 of then City Councilor Elaine D. Sembrano, returning to the proponent Punong Barangay Charles P. Ancheta Sr. of Honeymoon-Holyghost, for the urgent submission of a barangay ordinance mandating the establishment of a sat', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the following which were previously forwarded to the Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce on 18 February 2010 and 09 February 2010 respectively:\r\n           a.  Letter dated 15 February 2010 of Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista, Jr., requesting support for the realization of the proposed satellite market at Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay. Attached to said letter is a copy of the City Land Needs Identification Report and City Land Needs Inspection Report; and\r\n           b.  Undated letter of Punong Barangay Charles P. Ancheta Sr., Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as,  certifying that the proposed site for the establishment of a satellite market  at Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay is not a part of the barangay road right-of-way.)', 'attach to ind. FILE', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
