(19, '2010-04-03', '03:55:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Stephen Damogo noted by Mr. Carlos Monte, Vice President  and  President respectively of Dalicno Operators and Drivers Association (D.O.D.A.)', 'Letter dated 04 March 2010 of Mr. Stephen Damogo noted by Mr. Carlos Monte, Vice President  and  President respectively of Dalicno Operators and Drivers Association (D.O.D.A.) to then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., seeking reconsideration on His Hon', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated 05 November 2009 of Mr. Carlos Monte and Mr. Stephen Damogo, President and Vice President respectively, Dalicno Operators and Drivers Association (D.O.D.A.) to Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista, Jr., requesting that they be allowed to continue the use of Claudio Street toward Harrison Road, Baguio City, as their loading and unloading area. Attached is a copy of the Memorandum of Agreement by and between Punong Barangay Helen S. Medina of Harrison/Claudio/Carantes, Baguio City and Mr. Fernand Ediong, President of Dalicno Jeepney Operators and Drivers Association Inc., which was forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation on 10 November 2009.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '1st', '2010-08-03', '00278-10', 'In consonance with the two (2) proposed ordinances, PO 077-09 of Hon. Nicasio M. Aliping, Jr. and Hon. Richard A. Cari?o, entitled ?Proposed amendatory ordinance amending Ordinance No. 33, series of 2009? and PO 141-09 of Hon. Vice Mayor  Daniel  T. Fari?as, entitled ?Confirming and recognizing the designated parking and loading areas with the authorized number of units allowed, presently occupied by the different legitimate public utility jeepney associations in the City of Baguio?, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the present parking-loading  areas occupied by the three associations (and/or all the public utility jeepneys) with the minimum number of units be  MAINTAINED ON ?STATUS QUO? while awaiting their approval and promulgation. (CR NR. 00278-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 18a)', '3rd', '2010-06-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(20, '2010-04-03', '04:30:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. BautistaJr.', 'Letter dated 03 March 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., asking the Honorable Members of the City Council to prepare the necessary legislative measures on the following issues:\r\n     a. The possible withdrawal of the Office of the President', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '1st', '2010-10-03', '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation (8 Mar 2010, 56)', '1st', '2010-10-03', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
