(47, '2010-08-03', '04:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Armando Ramo, Chairman, Irisan  People?s Action Against Demolition and for Good Governance (IPADEGG)', 'Letter dated 09 March 2010 of Mr. Armando Ramo, Chairman, Irisan  People?s Action Against Demolition and for Good Governance (IPADEGG), informing among others that Civil Case No. 4735-R entitled ?Republic versus Sps. Villanueva et al.,? is not IPADEGG?s m', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated 19 February 2010 of Dir. Clarence L. Baguilat, CESO III, Regional Executive Director, Department of Environment and Natural Resources-Cordillera Administrative Region (DENR-CAR) to the City Secretary, informing among others that pending the resolution of issues raised in the matter of the 211 titles which are all of court issuance and not by DENR being questioned by the Irisan People?s Action Against Demolition and for Good Governance (IPADEGG) and all the parcels of land similarly circumstanced in the Court of Appeals, their office stand by its previous position and holds henceforth any further comment on the issue, which was NOTED during the 08 March 2010 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', '2010-09-03', '0415-10', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above letter of information BE NOTED. (CR NR. 0415-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 65)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(48, '2010-09-03', '11:45:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, City Budget Officer', '4th Indorsement dated 05 March 2010 of Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, City Budget Officer, returning with unfavorable recommendations the undated petition of the Alliance of Concerned Teachers- Metro Baguio, entitled ?Urging the Baguio City Council to immedia', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The said petition of the Alliance of Concerned Teachers-Metro Baguio was forwarded to the Local Finance Committee thru Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, Chairperson, Baguio City, on \r\n23 February 2010, to determine if there is available fund for possible inclusion in the 2010 Annual Budget and for their appropriate action, per recommendation of the Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research, approved during the 22 February 2010 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research', '5th', '2010-10-03', 'EDUC-2016-002', 'The Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research recommends that the matters be NOTED considering that the same have become moot. (EDUC-2016-002).', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2016-10-10', 'NOTED; informed proponent as per letter dated 11 October 2016  (10 October 2016, 15d); Unfinished (26 September 2016, 12d);', '-none-', NULL, 'acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
