(51, '2010-09-03', '01:45:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Punong Barangay William M. Hamada', 'Letter dated 25 February 2010 of Punong Barangay William M. Hamada, in behalf of the barangay officials of Burnham-Legarda Barangay, thanking  then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr. and the Honorable Members of the City Council for not allowing the cond', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated 04 February 2010 of  Punong Barangay William M. Hamada and endorsed by Barangay Kagawad Teodoro C. Castro, et al., all barangay officials of Burnham-Legarda Barangay, requesting the City Council to deny the conduct of ?Legarda Rocks? scheduled on February 12 to 14, 2010, at a mixed use area within the jurisdiction of the said barangay, which was returned to Punong Barangay Hamada with the information that during the 01 March 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, the said matter was noted for being moot and academic, per amended report of the Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds.)', 'furnished to the Hon. Members & Research Div. (attach to Panagbenga file) original copy (COMSEC file)', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(52, '2010-09-03', '03:35:00', '-none-', 'Draft of ?Heads of Agreement for Waste Processing Service Contract?', 'Waste to Energy (Asia Pacific) Pty Ltd  represented by Mr. Rob Rutherford, Chief Executive Officer and Baguio City, represented by Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. BautistaJr.', 'Draft of ?Heads of Agreement for Waste Processing Service Contract? between  Waste to Energy (Asia Pacific) Pty Ltd. represented by Mr. Rob Rutherford, Chief Executive Officer and Baguio City, represented by then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr. in rel', '-none-', '(NOTE: The above matter is related to the proposal submitted by Waste to Energy (Asia Pacific) Pty Ltd., regarding the Waste to Energy: Waste Management Solutions, which was passed on 15 March 2010 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '3rd', '2010-10-03', '00247-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be forwarded to the Technical Working Group of the Solid Waste Management Board for comments and recommendation and thereafter submit to the City Council their report seven (7) days upon receipt hereof. (CR NR. 00247-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'forwarded to the Technical Working Group of the Solid Waste Management Board for comments and recommendation and thereafter submit to the City Council their report seven (7) days upon receipt hereof (22 Mar 2010, 40)', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(53, '2010-09-03', '03:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. John Max B. Villaruz', 'Letter dated 05 March 2010 of Mr. John Max B. Villaruz, submitting documents for the transfer of rights of Lot 19, Block 25, at Res. Section ?H?, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City, with an area of 250 sq. meters, from the late Ms. Ramo', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', '2010-10-03', '0517-10', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the award of Lot 19, Block 25, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City to Ramona Villaruz be cancelled and the same BE AWARDED to applicant PATRICIO IRLAN DATU LEE subject to the provisions of Ordinance No. 65, series of 1948 as amended.\r\nAttached are the memorandum from the Office of the City Planning and Development Coordinator and pictures of improvement for further information and guidance.\r\nHon. Erdolfo V. Balajadia, Member of the Committee, signified ?May I inhibit.  The applicants are my close relatives. (CR NR. 0517-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (19 Jul 2010, 19)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
