(63, NULL, '04:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Tom C. Panis, President, Alpa-PCM, Inc.', 'Letter dated 13 April 2010 of Mr. Tom C. Panis, President, Alpa-PCM, Inc., furnishing a copy of Barangay Resolution No. 11, series of 2010, of Kias Barangay, entitled ?Resolution to recall Resolution No. 29, series of 2007 opposing the construction of a c', '-none-', '(NOTE:  a.   The above matter is related to the 3rd Indorsement dated 23 February 2010 of the City Secretary, returning to Mr. Tom C. Panis, President, ALPA-PCM his letter dated 08 January 2010 requesting the Honorable Members of the City Council to recall City Council Resolution Numbered 283, series of 2007 in relation to the proposed construction of a crematorium inside Pyramid Memorial Park located at Kias, Baguio City, with the information that during the 22 February 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, the said request was noted considering  Resolution Numbered 283, s. 2007,  of Kias Barangay, per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons.\r\n             b.  City Council Res. No. 283, s. 2007 supported Barangay Resolution No. 29, series of 2007 of Kias Barangay, entitled ?A resolution strongly opposing the construction of a crematorium by the Pyramid Memorial Park at the midst of the thickly populated residential houses at Barangay Kias, Baguio City.?)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '1st', NULL, '394-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the following personalities be present on the next regular session of the City Council to clarify issues on said crematorium to wit:\r\na.	Mr. Tom C. Panis ? President, ALPA-PCM, Inc.; \r\nb.	Engr. Moises C. Lozano ? City Environment and Parks Management Office; an