(78, NULL, '04:45:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. Gloria Ysabel V. De Vera', '7th Indorsement dated 13 April 2010 of Hon. Gloria Ysabel V. De Vera, forwarding the 6th Indorsement dated 22 March 2010 of the Local Finance Committee, with the information that the committee cannot certify as to the availability of funds, the surplus of', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the 6th Indorsement dated 25 February 2010 of Hon. Gloria Ysabel V. De Vera, forwarding  for referral to the Committee on Social Services, Women, and Urban Poor the Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 075-09 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as ?Establishing and operationalizing a Special Drug Education Center for out-of-school youths and street children, adopting the implementing policies of D.I.L.G. Memorandum Circular No. 2006-150, and appropriating the amount of One Million Pesos (Php1,000,000.00) from the Unappropriated Surplus of the 2009 Budget and every year thereafter?  to consolidate with  Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 153-07 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as ?for the establishment and operation of Special Drug Education Centers (SDEC) for out-of-school youth and street children and providing funds for its implementation?, which was forwarded to the Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor on  05 March 2010.)', 'Committee on Social Services, Women, and Urban Poor', '8th', NULL, 'SSWUP-2014-006', 'As contained in the 6th Indorsement dated March 22, 2010 that since the Local Finance Committee cannot certify as to the availability of funds, the proposal was endorsed to \"the Office of the City Social Welfare and Development Officer for further study and recommendations, being the implementing office of this particular concern.\"\r\n\r\nIn view thereof, the Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor recommends that this matter be OFFICIALLY FORWARDED to CSWDO for appropriate action. (SSWUP-2014-006)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to Ms. Betty F. Fangasa, for appropriate action', '10th', NULL, 'Acted upon. Related to PO 075-08 and PO 153-07, both of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as;', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
