(83, NULL, '08:20:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, Hon. Antonio R. Tabora Jr. and Hon. Richard A. Cari?o', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0070-10 of Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, then City Councilor Antonio R. Tabora Jr. and Hon. Richard A. Cari?o ?Renewing and revitalizing the enduring sister city ties of the City Government of Bagui', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated  30 March 2010 of Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., requesting the passage of a resolution to renew and revitalize the enduring sister city ties between Baguio City and Honolulu City, Hawaii, USA and to include in the said resolution  the necessity of a Protocol Officer to be appointed by the City Mayor and that Mr. Benedicto A. Alhambra, Secretary General, PHISTA-BCC, be tasked  among others with such responsibility. Attached to said letter is a copy of the faxed letter of Mr. John S. Chang, Internal Relations, City and County of Honolulu, regarding sister city relationship between Baguio City and Honolulu City, which was previously forwarded to the Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds on 07 April 2010.)', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '1st', NULL, '00344-10', 'The Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends APPROVAL of the above stated matters. (CR NR. 00344-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved - R-99 (17 May 2010, 46b)', '-none-', NULL, 'For Next Agenda', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
