(87, NULL, '10:50:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0071-10 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?For the conversion of the Irisan Medical Emergency Clinic into Medical Emergency and Lying-in/Birthing Clinic.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '1st', NULL, '00367-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be forwarded to  Dr. Florence G. Reyes, Health Services Officer for her comments and recommendations and thereafter submit to the committee for appropriate action. (CR NR. 00367-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'Forwarded to Dr. Florence G. Reyes, MD MPH MSc, City Health Officer, Baguio City, for comments and recommendations and thereafter submit to the committee for appropriate action (7 Jun 2010, 50)', '3rd', '2010-09-06', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(88, NULL, '02:45:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Josephine B. Paulino, President, Loakan Green Meadows Home Owners Association, Inc. (LGMHAI)', 'Letter dated 21 April 2010 of Ms. Josephine B. Paulino, President, Loakan Green Meadows Home Owners Association, Inc. (LGMHAI), submitting documents to support their application for Final Approval of their Subdivision Project covered by TCT No. T-84474, l', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, '0334-11', 'The subject lot is a fully occupied parcel of land titled in the Loakan Green Meadows Home Owners Association, Inc. All of the 113 occupants are members of the association-owner and the acquisition of lots by individual-beneficiaries is through the Community Mortgage Program of the government administered by the Social Housing Finance Corporation. For the said purpose, Resolution Numbered 243, series of 2002 was approved ?Approving the application of the Loakan Green Meadows HOA, Inc. or Preliminary Approval and Locational Clearance of the proposed Loakan Green Meadows Subdivision located at Magsaysay Drive, Loakan, Baguio city.? To date, the members are paying their monthly amortization to the SHFC with some members having already fully paid their obligations.\r\n           In view thereof, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends approval of the above subdivision.\r\n           Attached are the Memorandum Report from the Office of the City Planning and Development Coordinator dated 10 January 2011, Revised Subdivision Plan, LGMHAI Board Resolution No. 006-11 and the letter dated 14 April 2011 of Atty. Stephen P. Ovalles, Manager, Legal Department of the Social Housing Finance Corporation for further information and guidance. (CR NR. 0334-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2011-06-06', 'Unfinished (30 May 2011, 42)', '-none-', NULL, 'For Next Agenda', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(89, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 21 April 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 076, series of 2010, entitled ?Approving the request of the RFE Amusement Rides to conduct and install amusement rides at the left ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 13 April 2010 and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 21 April 2010.)', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Amend the Res. 076, s 2010 (26 Apr 2010, 60)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(90, NULL, '10:24:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Teresita P. De Guzman, General Manager, Baguio Water District', 'Letter dated 14 April 2010 of Ms. Teresita P. De Guzman, General Manager, Baguio Water District, acknowledging receipt of the letter dated 16 February 2010 of Ms. Maria Remedios C. Agranzamendez, Local Legislative Staff Officer V, regarding Resolution No.', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Res. No. 420, s. 2009 requested the Benguet Electric Cooperative (BENECO), Inc., the Baguio Water District, the telephone and cable companies, the hospitals and banks in the City of Baguio to grant discounts and moratorium in the payment of monthly bills of its consumers who suffered substantial damages caused by the recent typhoon.)', 'furnished to the Hon. Members & Research Div. (attach as supp. doc. of  Res. No. 420, s. 2009)', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(91, NULL, '02:10:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Atty. Clellan Bert P. Balba, attending Counsel of Baguio Upper San Carlos Heights Operators and Drivers Association (BUSCHODA)', 'Letter dated  22 April 2010 of Atty. Clellan Bert P. Balba, attending Counsel of Baguio Upper San Carlos Heights Operators and Drivers Association (BUSCHODA), suggesting that the City Council pass a resolution requesting DOTC-CAR for the conduct of a rout', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the following which were returned to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation on 23 October 2008, for the committee to conduct a public hearing and invite all affected arties to present their position on the matter:\r\na.	Letter dated 05 August 2008 of Punong Barangay Thomas K. Dumalti, et al, all members of the Sangguniang Barangay of Irisan, forwarding the request dated 25 July 2008 of the residents/commuters of Puroks 24, 24-a, 25, 27 and 28 of Upper San Carlos Heights, Irisan, that they be provided their own franchise to service the need of the riding public.\r\nb.	Letter dated 15 August 2008 of  Mr. Amadeo Garcia, President, San Carlos Heights Jeepney Operators and Drivers Association (SCHODA) to Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong, strongly opposing the granting or opening of a new line to cover Puroks 24, 24-A, 25, 26, 27 and 28, Upper San Carlos Heights, Irisan, Baguio City, on the grounds mentioned therein.\r\n     c.     Letter dated 10 September 2008 of  Atty. James S. Valeros, taxpayer/counsel for Quezon Hill Extension Tam-awan Operators and Drivers Association (QHEXTTODA), Mr. Johnny O. Lee, President, QHEXTTODA and Mr. George Rosario, Operator, San Carlos Extension to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, vehemently opposing the granting/endorsement of new line/franchise at San Carlos Heights, Irisan, Baguio City.\r\n         d.     Letter dated 24 September 2008 of Mr. Joseph Ingosan and Mr. Gabriel Espada, President and member of BUSCHODA respectively, asking discernment with justice and fairness be accorded to them regarding the letter of Mr. Amado Garcia, President, San Carlos Heights Jeepney Operators and Drivers Association (SCHODA), strongly opposing the granting or opening of a new line to cover Puroks 24, 24-A, 25, 26, 27 and 28, Upper San Carlos Heights, Irisan, Baguio City.\r\n      e.      Letter dated 24 September 2008 of Mr. Joseph Ingosan and Mr. Gabriel Espada, President     and member of BUSCHODA respectively, asking discernment with justice and fairness be accorded to them  regarding the  letter of  Atty. James S. Valeros, taxpayer/counsel for Quezon Hill Extension Tam-awan Operators and Drivers Association (QHEXTTODA), Mr. Johnny O. Lee, President, QHEXTTODA and Mr. George Rosario, Operator, San Carlos Extension, vehemently opposing the granting/endorsement of new line/franchise at San Carlos Heights, Irisan, Baguio City.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '1st', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(92, NULL, '02:20:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0072-10 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?On providing financial assistance to the Softball Team Baguio City host team to the annual Amateur Softball Association of the Philippines National Softball Open on May 1-7, 2010.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development', '1st', NULL, '00435-10', 'The Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development recommends that the matter be NOTED. The matter has been forwarded to the City Sports Development Office which is the office-in-charge of the sports fund. (CR NR. 00435-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED since the matter has been forwarded to the City Sports Development Office which is the office-in-charge of the sports fund (21 Jun 2010, 79)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42');
INSERT INTO `city_records` (`id`, `Date_Received`, `Time_Received`, `Ref_No`, `Type`, `Proponent`, `Subject`, `Subject_Description`, `Subject_Notation`, `Committee_Referred`, `Indorsement1`, `Date_Indorsed1`, `Com_Rep_Nr`, `Com_Rep`, `Com_Rep_Date_Received`, `Item_Nr`, `Agenda_Date`, `Action_Taken`, `Indorsement2`, `Indorsement2_Date`, `Remarks`, `Folder`, `created_at`) VALUES
(93, NULL, '09:45:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Edward Madongit, President, Baguio-Trinidad Operators and Drivers Association (BTODA), Mr. Avelino Tom, President, Camp Dangwa Operators and Drivers Association (CADODA) and Mr. David Aragon, President , Tomay Greenfields, Incorporated (TGI)', 'Letter dated 23 April 2010 of Mr. Edward Madongit, President, Baguio-Trinidad Operators and Drivers Association (BTODA), Mr. Avelino Tom, President, Camp Dangwa Operators and Drivers Association (CADODA) and Mr. David Aragon, President , Tomay Greenfields', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '6th', '2010-08-07', '0553-10', 'IDue to public clamor of the riding public as well as the numerous requests, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the public utility vehicles of La Trinidad, Benguet belonging to the six (6) associations namely:\r\nAssociation    No. of Units\r\nBTODA                88\r\nCADODA              50\r\nLATJODA             66\r\nPPLMJODA          23\r\nTGFI                    80\r\nBODA                100\r\nTotal                  407\r\nwill be allowed to traverse Buhagan Road (formerly Bokawkan Road) in coming in and out of the City of Baguio, subject to the conditions stated in its 1st Indorsement dated 23 July 2010. (CR NR. 0553-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Experimental basis for 20 days (26 Jul 2010, 45e)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the same committee, 2nd Ind, 28 Apr 2010]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(94, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Prudencio M. Parnacio, City Secretary', 'Letter dated 26 April 2010 of Mr. Prudencio M. Parnacio, City Secretary to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, requesting that the amount of Fifteen Thousand Pesos (P15,000.00) be transferred to Account No. 893 (Insurance Expenses) from Account No. 753 (Tr', '-none-', '-none-', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (26 Apr 2010, 61)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(95, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'List of accredited members', 'Hon. Richard A. Cari?o', 'List of accredited members together with the respective operators and plate numbers marked as Annex ?A? submitted by the Office of Hon. Richard A. Cari?o.', '-none-', '(NOTE: The above matter was included  as part of Item 62 during the 26 April 2010 Regular  of the Sangguniang Panlungsod.)', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Deferred (26 Apr 2010, 62b)', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(96, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 077-09 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?Favorably recommending to the LTFRB the granting of a Certificate of Public Convenience (CPC) under the Garage to Terminal Express Services Program to the 132 units which have existing fr', '-none-', '(NOTE:  [a] Letter dated 29 November 2007  of Mr. Rodolfo L. Egsan, Tadian Baguio Bontoc Van Operators and Drivers Assn. Inc. (TABBVODA) and Mr. Richard Wacnisen, Kankanaey Kalanguya Ilocano-Ibaloi Van Association (KKAIVA), requesting the assistance of the City Council for the favorable endorsement of the issuance of their applications for UV conversion under the GT Express Program of the LTFRB and thereby submitting the list of vehicles for hire operators who are operating the line Baguio City-Tadian/Bontoc and vice versa since 1998 and Baguio City-Solano via Ambuklao Road and vice versa, respectively; and\r\n             [b] Letter of opposition dated 28 December 2007 of the different bus operators with legitimate franchises to Hon. Fred L. Bagbagen on the appeal of the Tadian-Baguio Bontoc Van Operators and Drivers Association (TABBVODA) for its inclusion in the City Council resolution that recommends the conversion of van-for-hire into garage terminal express.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '-none-', NULL, '00333-10', 'The Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation reviewed and evaluated the proposal including the documents submitted by the applicants and consolidated the facts stated in its 4th Indorsement dated 10 March 2010.\r\n              Taking cognizance of the deadline set for the filing of applications for the conversion has lapsed, that is, until June 30, 2007 and the failure of the applicants to submit photocopies of their Certificates of Public Convenience as required by the LTFRB-DOTC CAR for verification purposes, the Committee recommends to APPROVE Proposed Resolution No. PR 077-09. (CR NR. 00333-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 26)', '5th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(97, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Advance Notice to Avail of the Citizen?s Forum', 'Ms. Aurora T. Valbuena, Mr. Amancio Salvador and Mr. Nelson F. Lidua Sr.', 'Advance Notice to Avail of the Citizen?s Forum of Ms. Aurora T. Valbuena, Mr. Amancio Salvador and Mr. Nelson F. Lidua Sr., regarding the request of retired government employees for the release of benefits from GSIS.', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Ms. Aurora T. Valbuena submitted a letter dated 23 April 2010 during the Citizen?s Forum of the 26 April 2010 Regular Session requesting for a resolution on the request of retired government employees seeking release of benefits from the GSIS.)', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'A Resolution was approved for the purpose (26 Apr 2010, CF1)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(98, NULL, '03:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Tereso O. Panga, Deputy Director General for Policy and Planning', 'Letter dated 23 April 2010 of Mr. Tereso O. Panga, Deputy Director General for Policy and Planning to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, informing among others the status of the request for immediate release of the P125 Million tax share of the City of Ba', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Res. No. 045, s. 2010 reiterated the request for the immediate release of the P125 Million tax share of the City of Baguio from the operations of the Philippine Economic Zone Authority (PEZA), which fund can be utilized by the city government in the development of the Baguio Athletic Bowl.)', 'furnished to the Honorable Members and Research Div. (attach as supp. doc. of Res. No. 045, s. 2010)', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(99, NULL, '03:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Norma Nichols', 'Letter dated 26 April 2010 of Ms. Norma Nichols, seeking intervention to defer the implementation of Demolition Order No. 13, series of 2008 of her structure  located at  Purok 15, Irisan Barangay, Baguio City.', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '2nd', NULL, '0194-11', 'With the implementation of Demolition Order No. 13, series of 2008 on June 3, 2010, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter BE NOTED. (CR NR. 0194-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED - returned to Ms. Norma Nichols, Purok 15, Irisan, Baguio City, with the information that during the 28 March 2011 Regular Session the above matter was noted.\r\nDemolition Order No. 13, series of 2008 was implemented on 03 June 2010. (28 Mar 2011, 73)', '6th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(100, NULL, '09:18:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 22 April 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 400, series of 2009, entitled ?Approving the request for the installation of a separate water meter of the Registry of Deeds, Land ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 22 October 2009 and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 27 April 2010.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', NULL, '00474-10', 'A resolution is a format or written expression of opinion, sentiment, or intention. It is also the act of determining what action or course of action to be done. There are also non-binding resolutions, which are measures that do not become laws.\r\n       The City Mayor returned the above mentioned resolutions unsigned but with comments, which is neither an approval nor a veto. His intention is not known whether he agrees or disagrees with the City Council?s expression of opinions or sentiments.\r\n        Wherefore, considering that a resolution is an expression of a sentiment, opinion or intention, the Committee on Laws shall treat the unsigned city Council Resolutions effective for all legal intents and purposes. \r\n      Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?For discussion en banc please?. (CR NR. 00474-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 61b)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
