(107, NULL, '10:15:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, City Treasurer', '6th Indorsement dated 29 April 2010 of Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, City Treasurer, submitting her comment  on the  letter dated 06 July 2009 of Ms. Gertrudes A. Tan and Ms. Elsa Bona A. Alday, requesting council resolution for the transfer of leasehold right o', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the 5th Indorsement dated 20 October 2009 of the City Secretary, forwarding to Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, Baguio City, the letter of Ms.  Gertrudes A. Tan and Ms. Elsa Bona A. Alday, for comment, recommendation and appropriate action, considering that the building erected on the city?s owned lot was sold by the deceased lessee, Felicidad F. Alina in the year 2004 as evidenced by the proponent?s admission of the sale in their letter dated July 6, 2009 and the deed of absolute sale of commercial building with assignment of leasehold rights executed on August 31, 2004, per recommendation of the Committee on Laws, approved in the 19 October 2009 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod.)', 'Committee on Laws', '7th', '2010-04-05', '0021-11', 'Finding that Ms. Elsa Bona A. Alday is the daughter of the deceased Felicidad F. Alina as appears in her birth certificate, the Committee on Laws recommends APPROVAL of the request to transfer the leasehold right over Lot No. 10, Block 2 at Market Hilltop Subdivision from Ms. Felicidad F. Alina to her daughter and sole heir Elsa Bona A. Alday as contained in a letter request dated November 11, 2010.\r\n              This supersedes the Committee Report dated 18 May 2010 which was not acted upon by the Sangguniang Panlungsod. Attached herewith are the copy of tax declaration, updated certificate of non-tax delinquency, certificate that the lot rental for January 2011 was paid, joint affidavit of Gertrudes A. Tan and Elsa Bona A. Alday, photocopy of Certificate of Live Birth and Affidavit of Self Adjudication of Ms. Elsa Bona A. Alday. (CR NR. 0021-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved; Res-032-2011 (31 Jan 2011, 45); Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation;', '9th', '2010-07-07', 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(108, '2010-04-05', '09:35:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Local Finance Committee', '4th Indorsement dated 19 April 2010 of the Local Finance Committee, returning the Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 129-09 of  then City Councilor Galo D. Weygan ?Appropriating the sum of One Million (P1,000,000.00) Pesos from the General Fund or operation saving', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above proposed ordinance  was forwarded to the Local finance Committee thru Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, Chairperson, Baguio City, for inclusion during the deliberation of the 2010 Annual Budget, per recommendation of the Committee on Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster A, approved during the 22 February 2010 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A: Budget, Appropriations and Expenditures)', '5th', '2010-05-05', '00441-10', 'The Committee on Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster A, recommends that the above proposed ordinance be RETURNED to the proponent in view of the comments of the Local Finance Committee as contained in the 4th Indorsement dated 19 April 2010. (CR NR. 00441-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'RETURNED to the proponent, Hon. Galo D. Weygan, SP Member II, in view of the comments of the Local Finance Committee as contained in the 4th Indorsement dated 19 April 2010 (21 Jun 2010, 85)', '7th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
