(114, '2010-04-05', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', 'Letter dated 23 April 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., requesting a certified copy of the receipt letter addressed to the Honorable City Council terminating the contract entered into by and between the City Government of Baguio and Data M', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the following:\r\na.  3rd Indorsement dated 14 November 2008 of Atty. Melchor Carlos R. Rabanes, OIC, City Legal Officer, forwarding his recommendation regarding the letter  dated 08 August 2008 of Atty. Edgar M. Avila urging His Honor to rescind the contract between the city and Woodfields Consultants, Inc. and stop its implementation to avoid complications of judicial action which was forwarded to the Committee on Laws on 19 November 2008;\r\n       b.   Letter  dated  22  August 2008 of  Hon. City  Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista, Jr. to the Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as and Honorable Members of the City Council, forwarding for comment and appropriate action the letter dated 08 August 2008 of Atty. Edgar M. Avila urging His Honor to rescind the contract between the city and Woodfields Consultants, Inc. and stop its implementation to avoid complications of judicial action which was forwarded to the Committee on Laws on 27 August 2008.)', 'letter to Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(115, '2010-04-05', '02:50:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani,  President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation', 'Letter dated 04 May 2010 of Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani,  President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, requesting the passage of an ordinance adopting and approving the December 2, 2009 proposal ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated 15 March 2010 of Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, regarding the following, which was returned to  Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani on 13 April 2010, with the information that during the 12 April 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, the said matter was noted considering that the Technical Working Group of the Solid Waste Management is coming up with the final evaluation of all the proposals submitted to them, per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons:\r\n                   a.	reiterating their position to pursue their previous proposal and to comply with the criteria embodied in Resolution No. 480, series of 2009; and \r\n b.	informing that their proposal was not included in the list of proponents evaluated by the Technical Working Group on alternative Solid Waste Management Technologies.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environemtnal Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '2nd', '2010-05-05', '00438-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be NOTED until such time that the Technical Working Group of the Solid Waste Management come up with the final evaluation of all the proponents. As soon as all proponents have been evaluated, the committee suggests that the Technical Working Group shall inform the same if they are qualified and apposite for the project of the City of Baguio. This is to avoid numerous repetition of the same committee report being furnished by the committee. (CR NR. 00438-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 82)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(116, '2010-04-05', '02:50:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Carlos Evangelista and Ms. Clarita Evangelista', 'Letter dated 14 April 2010 of the spouses Mr. Carlos Evangelista and Ms. Clarita Evangelista, requesting the transfer of leasehold rights over Lot No. 13, Block 2, Hilltop Road, Baguio City, containing an area of 70 square meters in favor  of their sister', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', '2010-05-05', '0526-10', 'Finding the transferee qualified, and has complied with Section 137 paragraph 5 of Tax Ordinance Numbered 200-001, the Committee on Laws recommends to approve the request for transfer of leasehold right over Lot 13 Block 2 situated at Hilltop, Baguio City, from Carlos Evangelista and Clarita Evangelista to their sister, for the remaining period of the lease contract executed by the City of Baguio, represented by then City Mayor Mauricio G. Domogan and Carlos and Clarita Evangelista.\r\n          The Committee on Laws recommends further that Ms. Pacita Yu Sam be allowed to pay transferor and transferees fees, and al other necessary charges and fees required by the City Treasurer?s Office.\r\n           Herein attached are the declaration of real property still in the name of the  City of Baguio, Certificate of Non-Delinquency, Certification from the City Treasurer?s Office that the monthly rental for Lot 13, Block 2 is up to date. (CR NR. 0526-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved; Res-163-2010 (16 Aug 2010, 6)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon; Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation, 4th Ind., 07 Jul 2010;', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
