(118, '2010-05-05', '10:40:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Punong Barangay Carlos P. Ananayo, Lower Rock Quarry Barangay', 'Letter dated 23 March 2010 of Punong Barangay Carlos P. Ananayo, Lower Rock Quarry Barangay forwarding for review their Barangay Ordinance No. 01, series of 2010, entitled ?An ordinance imposing Tax Ordinance No. 1, series of 2010 for barangay satellite m', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster C: Review of Barangay Budgets and Barangay Tax Ordinances; Accreditation of NGOs and other concerns)', '1st', '2010-06-05', '00357-10', 'Considering that the foregoing ordinance showed compliance with Section 186 and 187 of the Local Government Code mandating that ordinances levying taxes, fees, or charges shall be the subject of a public hearing prior to its enactment, as could be evidenced by the hereto attached minutes of the meeting and attendance to the general assembly, the Committee on Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster C, recommends FAVORABLE REVIEW of the above mentioned barangay ordinance. (CR NR. 00357-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'Approved (7 Jun 2010, 39) R-104, s. 2010', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
