(127, '2010-05-05', '02:45:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'City Engr. Leo C. BernardezJr.', 'Letter dated 05 May 2010 of City Engr. Leo C. Bernardez Jr. to Hon.  City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., submitting the following:\r\na.	status report of infrastructure projects (Planning, Programming and Construction Division, CEO)  as of 03 May 2010; and', '-none-', '-none-', 'furnished to the Hon. Members', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(128, '2010-06-05', '03:20:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 06 May 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 083, series of 2010, entitled ?Recommending the conduct of an Inter-Local Government Unit Consultation and Planning Conference for th', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 05 May  2010  and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 06 May 2010.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', NULL, '00474-10', 'A resolution is a format or written expression of opinion, sentiment, or intention. It is also the act of determining what action or course of action to be done. There are also non-binding resolutions, which are measures that do not become laws.\r\n       The City Mayor returned the above mentioned resolutions unsigned but with comments, which is neither an approval nor a veto. His intention is not known whether he agrees or disagrees with the City Council?s expression of opinions or sentiments.\r\n        Wherefore, considering that a resolution is an expression of a sentiment, opinion or intention, the Committee on Laws shall treat the unsigned city Council Resolutions effective for all legal intents and purposes. \r\n      Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?For discussion en banc please?. (CR NR. 00474-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 61g)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(129, '2010-06-05', '03:20:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 06 May 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 087, series of 2010, entitled ?For the conversion of all district health centers into Philippine Health Insurance Corporation (PHILHE', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 05 May  2010  and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 06 May 2010.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', NULL, '00474-10', 'A resolution is a format or written expression of opinion, sentiment, or intention. It is also the act of determining what action or course of action to be done. There are also non-binding resolutions, which are measures that do not become laws.\r\n       The City Mayor returned the above mentioned resolutions unsigned but with comments, which is neither an approval nor a veto. His intention is not known whether he agrees or disagrees with the City Council?s expression of opinions or sentiments.\r\n        Wherefore, considering that a resolution is an expression of a sentiment, opinion or intention, the Committee on Laws shall treat the unsigned city Council Resolutions effective for all legal intents and purposes. \r\n      Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?For discussion en banc please?. (CR NR. 00474-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 61h)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(130, '2010-06-05', '04:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Dir. Ferdy K. Bayasen, Board President, Benguet Electric Cooperative, Inc.', 'Letter dated 30 April 2010 of Dir. Ferdy K. Bayasen, Board President, Benguet Electric Cooperative, Inc., regarding the investigation or inquiry on BENECO?s purchase of a prime 1.2 hectare lot.', '-none-', '(NOTE: The above matter is related to the following resolutions approved by the City Council during its 08 March 2010 Regular Session  and received for approval by the Office of the City Mayor on 12 April 2010.)  (Item 57, 08 March 2010 Agenda)\r\na) Res. No. 055, s. 2010, resolving that the Benguet Electric Cooperative, Inc. (BENECO) comply with its obligations? to the consumers pursuant to the energy regulatory commission board.\r\nb) Res. No. 056, s. 2010, requesting the Benguet Electric Cooperative, Inc. (BENECO) to submit all pertinent documents regarding it?s purchase of lot to the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council) in aid of legislation.\r\nc) Res. No. 059, s. 2010, authorizing the City Atty. Melchor Carlos R. Rabanes, Officer-In-Charge, City Legal Office  to conduct an investigation on the purchase of lots by the Benguet Electric Cooperative, Inc. (BENECO) and to file the necessary administrative and criminal charges pursuant to Section 46 of the EPIRA In behalf of the city being a valued client of BENECO.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '2nd', '2010-07-05', '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
