(135, '2010-11-05', '04:45:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 0041-10 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?Appropriating the amount of Three Hundred Thousand Pesos (P300,000.00) for payment of copies of the Society of Outstanding Citizens of Baguio (SOCOB) Book which shall be released during t', '-none-', '(NOTE:  FIRST READING ? 17 May 2010)', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A:)', '1st', NULL, '0796-10', 'The Committee on Ways and Means and Finance [Cluster A] recommends that the above mentioned proposed ordinance be returned to the proponent in view of the comments of the Local Finance Committee as contained in the 3rd Indorsement dated 23 August 2010, hereto attached, which states that the committee regrets its inability to certify funds for the purpose, the Surplus of the General Fund having been fully appropriated in the Annual Budget. (Cr NR. 0796-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'returned to the proponent, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, SP Member II, Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, in view of the comments of the Local Finance Committee as contained in the 3rd Indorsement dated 23 August 2010, hereto attached, which states that the committee regrets its inability to certify funds for the purpose, the Surplus of the General Fund having been fully appropriated in the Annual Budget (27 Sep 2010, 59)', '5th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
