(145, '2010-12-05', '01:35:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 11 May 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 088, series of 2010, entitled ?Identifying business establishments and stalls selling processed food products, souvenir items, and ha', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 06 May 2010 and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 12 May 2010.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', NULL, '00474-10', 'A resolution is a format or written expression of opinion, sentiment, or intention. It is also the act of determining what action or course of action to be done. There are also non-binding resolutions, which are measures that do not become laws.\r\n       The City Mayor returned the above mentioned resolutions unsigned but with comments, which is neither an approval nor a veto. His intention is not known whether he agrees or disagrees with the City Council?s expression of opinions or sentiments.\r\n        Wherefore, considering that a resolution is an expression of a sentiment, opinion or intention, the Committee on Laws shall treat the unsigned city Council Resolutions effective for all legal intents and purposes. \r\n      Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?For discussion en banc please?. (CR NR. 00474-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 61i)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
