(165, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Undated handwritten petition', 'Slaughterhouse Compound Barangay, Baguio City', 'Undated handwritten petition of concerned residents of Slaughterhouse Compound Barangay, Baguio City, to Hon. Richard A. Cari?o, requesting assistance for the immediate demolition of the illegal bingo game in their barangay.', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the  undated handwritten petition of concerned residents of Slaughterhouse Compound Barangay, Baguio City to Hon. Fred L. Bagbagen, appealing to His Honor for the immediate removal/dismantling of illegal bingo games at Slaughterhouse Compound Barangay, Baguio City, which was forwarded to Police Senior Superintendent Agripino G. Javier, City Police Director, Baguio City Police Office (BCPO), Baguio City, to conduct an investigation and for appropriate action, per recommendation of the Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order, approved during the 16 November 2009 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order', '3rd', NULL, '388-10', 'The Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order recommends to refer the undated handwritten petition to PS/Supt. Roberto Quinto Soriano, DSC, Officer-in-Charge, Baguio City Police Office (BCPO), to conduct an investigation and for appropriate action relative to the alleged illegal bingo in Sto. Ni?o (Slaughterhouse Compound) Barangay. (CR NR. 388-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'Referred to PS/Supt. Roberto Quinto Soriano, DSC, Officer-in-Charge, Baguio City Police Office (BCPO), to conduct an investigation and for appropriate action relative to the alleged illegal bingo in Sto. Ni?o (Slaughterhouse Compound) Barangay (7 Jun 2010, 69)', '5th', '2010-09-06', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(166, NULL, '10:40:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Atty. Federico J. MandapatJr., Regional Director, Department of Transportation and Communications-Cordillera Administrative Region (DOTC-CAR)', 'Letter dated  13 May 2010 of Atty. Federico J. Mandapat Jr., Regional Director, Department of Transportation and Communications-Cordillera Administrative Region (DOTC-CAR), requesting the Honorable City Council to issue a resolution for exemption from LTF', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the  letter dated 26 April 2010 of the commuters and passengers of the Proper Virac, Camatisan, Bubon Kias Itogon, Benguet to Punong Barangay Castillo Kiwang, Virac, Itogon, Benguet, seeking among others assistance to address their jeepney transportation concerns, which was furnished to the Hon. Members of the City Council on 04 May 2010.)', 'Committee on Laws', '4th', '2010-07-07', '0458-10', 'Primordial consideration in the grant of a certificate of convenience is the interest and welfare of the riding public.  The grant of a franchise to an applicant is espoused by the objective of public service.  Other pertinent and important requirements are technical in nature and left to the discretion of the approving office like the LTFRB and City Council.\r\n            In order that the welfare of the residents and commuters of Bubon, Virac, Itogon, Benguet be given action, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the herein listed applicants for the issuance of new franchises be EXEMPTED from the application of LTFRB MC No. 96-002 provided that their parking/loading area shall not be within the Central Business District. (CR NR. 0458-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 52a)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation, 2nd Ind, 16 Jun 2010]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
