(188, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Erdolfo G. Ocampo', 'Undated letter of Mr. Erdolfo G. Ocampo to then City Councilor Faustino A. Olowan, submitting his application for the transfer of Lot. No. 4, Block 18, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City, with an area of 164 square meters from Mr. Felim', 'Transfer of lot', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '2nd', NULL, '1170-09', 'Having satisfied the requirements as provided for by Ordinance No. 65-48 as amended, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the award of Lot 4, Block 18, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City to Mr. Felimon A. Asperin Sr. be cancelled and the same BE AWARDED to applicant Mr. Erdolfo G. Ocampo subject to the three (3) meter creek easement.\r\n           Attached are the memorandum report from the City Planning and Development Office, receipt for the payment of transferor-transferee fee and pictures of improvement. (CR NR. 1170-09)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
