(190, NULL, '04:40:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 042-07 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr., entitled ?The Reproductive Health Care Code of Baguio City.?', '042-07', '-none-', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '1st', NULL, '08-527', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection recommends that the above proposed ordinance be NOTED considering that as per 3rd Indorsement dated 05 September 2007 by Dr. Florence G. Reyes, City Health Officer, Baguio City, the components of the reproductive health program already exists, in place, and is being implemented by the different divisions and programs in their office. Thus, its creation will lead to duplication of functions and responsibilities.      Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, Member of the Committee, signified ?I am in favor of the proposed ordinance, sans the creation of the Reproductive Health Care divisions.? (CR NR. 527-08)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted Upon', 'Hon. Leandro B. Yangot, Jr. 2007', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
