(227, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Resolution', 'Integrated Bar of the Philippines Baguio-Benguet Chapter', 'Resolution No. 11, series of 2007, of the Integrated Bar of the Philippines Baguio-Benguet Chapter, entitled ?A resolution requesting the Sangguniang Panlungsod of Baguio City to grant usufruct to the Integrated Bar of the Philippines Baguio-Benguet Chapt', 'IBP Building', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, '0901-10', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter be RETURNED to the Integrated Bar of the Philippines, Baguio-Benguet Chapter with the hereto attached 2nd Indorsement dated 21 July 2009 of then City Planning and Development Coordinator, Arturo L. Orig and the letter dated 11 December 2007 of then District Engineer Nerie D. Bueno of the Baguio City District Engineering Office, DPWH-CAR.\r\n            Further, for the IBP, Baguio-Benguet Chapter to seek anew the permission of the Department of Public Works and Highways for the purpose contemplated. (CR NR. 0901-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'RETURNED to the Integrated Bar of the Philippines, Baguio-Benguet Chapter through Atty. Daniel D. Mangallay, President, Unit 317, 3rd Floor, Justice Hall, Baguio City, with the hereto attached 2nd Indorsement dated 21 July 2009 of then City Planning and Development Coordinator, Arturo L. Orig and the letter dated 11 December 2007 of then District Engineer Nerie D. Bueno of the Baguio City District Engineering Office, DPWH-CAR.\r\n            The Iintegrated Bar of the Philippines, Baguio-Benguet Chapter should seek anew the permission of the Department of Public Works and Highways for the purpose contemplated (24 Jan 2011, 28)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(228, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. Reinaldo A. Bautista, City Mayor', '1st Indorsement dated 21 August 2007 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., forwarding the letter dated 15 August 2007 of Mr. Jose S. Dacawi, City Human Resource Management Officer to then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., informing His Honor tha', 'hiring of Casuals', '(NOTE: a. The letter dated 16 August 2007 of Ms. Betty F. Fangasan, City Social Welfare and Development Officer to then City Councilor Galo D. Weygan, requesting amendment of Resolution Nr. 129, series of 2007 particularly on the ?renewal of appointments of casuals? to ?hire casuals? for the period July to December 2007 was forwarded to the Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel on 22 August 2007.      \r\nb. Res. Nr. 129, s. 2007 approved the request for the renewal of appointments of one (1) Social Welfare Officer III, three (3) Social Welfare Officer I, eleven (11) Social Welfare Aide, one (1) Day Care Worker I, and one (1) Administrative Aide IV on casual status for the period July to December 2007 in the City Social Welfare and Development Office.)', 'Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel', '2nd', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
