(231, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Resolution', 'AZKCO Barangay', 'Letter dated 18 August 2007 of Brgy. Kag. Amelita S. Mangaoang, Chairman, Public Utilities noted by OIC, Punong Barangay Bartolome K. Cheng, AZKCO to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, requesting approval of their Resolution No. 07, series of 2007 ?A reso', 'Brgy Res 07-2007', '(NOTE: The letter dated 13 August 2007 of Atty. Romeo P. Rillera, counsel for  Lourdes-Dominican Operators/Drivers Association (LDODA) and Mr. Danilo Serdan, President, LDODA, praying to the August Body to rectify and chastise AZCKO Barangay Council in enacting Resolution No. 07, series of 2007 ?allowing the three existing jeepneys  with franchise plying the route of Lourdes-Dominican-plaza to have a parking or loading area within the jurisdiction of this barangay, particularly at Lower Kayang St.? was forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation on 15 August 2007.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '1st', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Back to Barangay', '5th', '2008-11-03', 'Acted Upon', 'Barangay', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
