(234, NULL, '03:50:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Brenda Viloria, et al., heirs and awardees of lots at Quirino-Magsaysay Subdivision', 'Letter dated 23 August 2007, of Ms. Brenda Viloria, et al., heirs and awardees of lots at Quirino-Magsaysay Subdivision to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, petitioning for an urgent meeting with the August Body regarding the finalization of award of lot', 'Award of Lots', '(NOTE:  Res. No. 409-70  allocated lots in the Quirino-Magsaysay Subdivision to qualified applicants.)', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, '020-09', 'Subject lot is a portion of a city property located at GEFA Barangay, Baguio city covered by Transfer Certificate of Title No. T-93565 in the name of the City of Baguio containing an area of 356 square meters. The titled city lot was subdivided into three lots as per approved plan for Psd-CAR-015976 of Lot 188-A-Psd-CAR-012635 executed by Engr. Augustin N. Pisilen on May 13, 2006 and approved by the LMS-DENR-CAR on May 13, 2008. One of the subject lot is identified as Lot 188-A-1-A with an area of 124 square meters. This was awarded to MS. BRENDA C. VILORIA by virtue of City Council Resolution No. 409, series of 1970. The purchase price had been fully paid, the same was not yet transferred to the awardee, Brenda C. Viloria, co-petitioners Pedro Sedano and Victorina Palconit had their areas already transferred in their names.\r\n       In view thereof, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the hereto attached documents of Brenda Viloria BE FORWARDED to the Office of the City Legal Officer, Atty. Melchor Carlos R. Rabanes, to cause the preparation and execution of the required documents for the transfer of Lot 188-A-1-A from the City Government of Baguio to the awardee Brenda C. Viloria, subject to payment of proper taxes, fees and other charges by the transferee. (CR NR. 020-09)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2009-12-01', 'FORWARDED to the Office of the City Legal Office', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', 'City Legal Office', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
