(251, '2007-06-12', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Resolution', 'Sangguniang Panlalawigan of Benguet', 'Resolution No. 07-289, of the Sangguniang Panlalawigan of La Trinidad, Benguet, entitled ?Strongly supporting petition letter dated November 22, 2007 of the jeepney operators and drivers association who have loading and unloading sites/stations in Baguio ', 'Res 07-289', '(NOTE:  a.)  Attached is a photocopy of  the  letter dated 22 November 2007, of the jeepney operators and drivers who have loading and unloading sites/stations in Baguio City, vehemently opposing  Proposed Ord. No. 083-07, for the reasons mentioned therein .\r\nb.)  The Proposed Ord. No. 083-07 of Hon. Nicasio M. Aliping Jr., entitled ?Amending Ordinance No. 01, series of 2003, known as the Baguio City Number Coding Scheme (BCNCS), as amended? was forwarded to the Committee on Laws on  08 October 2007.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', '2007-10-12', '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
