(331, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Galo D. Weygan', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 247-04 of then City Councilor Galo D. Weygan \"Adopting thee two-child policy and to encourage its observance by the people and provide the means by which it can be implemented in Baguio.\"', '247-04', '-none-', 'Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor', '1st', NULL, '00396-10', 'The determination of how many children a couple will have should be a personal choice.  The State cannot dictate on this issue lest it violate the human rights of the couple.  Instead, couples should be encouraged  to practice responsible parenthood.\r\nIn view of the above, the Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor respectfully recommends that the above proposal be NOTED.\r\nHon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, a member of the committee, signified: ?For public hearing please.?(CR NR. 00396-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 56)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
