(390, NULL, '03:20:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Daniel T. Farinas', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 106-05 of Hon. Daniel T. Fari?as \"Allocating the amount of Ten Million Pesos (P10,000,000.00) to be known as Alternative Market Development Fund, purposely for the improvement and development of the City Public Market and other s', '106-05', '-none-', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A: Budget, Appropriations and Expenditures)', '1st', '2005-04-10', 'Jul-53', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Local Finance Committee', '1st', '2007-01-02', 'Acted Upon', 'Local Finance Committee', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
