(419, NULL, '10:45:00', '-none-', 'Handwritten letter', 'Mr. Danilo A. Labo', 'Handwritten letter dated 20 May 2010 of Mr. Danilo A. Labo to then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., requesting intervention on the issue of illegal digging allegedly headed by Punong Barangay Thomas K. Dumalti, et al., traversing the national road in ', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order', '2nd', NULL, '0003-12', 'The Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order  recommends that the above mentioned letter be NOTED considering that this is already MOOT AND ACADEMIC on the reason that after an ocular inspection, the excavated section with less than 1 sq. m. area was already patched with cement mortar. (CR NR. 0003-12)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED for being MOOT and ACADEMIC - returned to Mr. Danilo A. Labo, #10 Purok 18, Irisan, Baguio City, with the information that during the 20 February 2012 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, the above letter was noted for being moot and academic.\r\n\r\nAfter and ocular inspection, the excavated section with less than 1sq. M. area was already patched with cement mortar. (20 Feb 2012, 26)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
