(423, NULL, '01:30:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Freddy Cayetano Manguinao, COO, Manguinao Development and Construction Co. Inc. (MADECCO)', 'Letter dated 24 May 2010 of Mr. Freddy Cayetano Manguinao, COO, Manguinao Development and Construction Co. Inc. (MADECCO), proposing a project consisting of open cable car cabin and ziplines at Burnham or Mines View Park.', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '3rd', NULL, '0042-11', 'The Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends to forward the proposal of Mr. Freddy Cayetano Manguinao, COO, MADECCO to the Office of the City Mayor for evaluation and submission of additional documents for their plan to put up an open cable car and zipline at Mines View Park, and to inform the proponent that their proposal is not feasible at the Burnham Park at the moment due to the pending implementation of the Final Master Development Plan of Burnham Park.\r\n           Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?I proposed to invite proponent to make a presentation at the Council too.? (CR NR. 0042-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'returned to Mr. Freddy Cayetano Manguinao, COO, Maguinao Development and Construction Co. Inc. (MADECCO), 471 Barangay Sungay East, Tagaytay City, for submission of additional documents for their plan to put up an open cable car and zipline at Mines View Park and presentation of said plan to the Sangguniang Panlungsod of Baguio.\r\nThis is to inform the proponent that theabove proposal is not feasible at the Burnham Park at the moment due to the pending implementation of the Final Master Development Plan of Burnham Park.\r\nThe proponent is also informed that the above proposal was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor for evaluation; and forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor, Baguio City, for evaluation (31 Jan 2011, 54)', '5th', '2011-03-02', 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
