(427, NULL, '03:12:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Resolutions', 'Pinsao Pilot Project Barangay', 'a.  Bareangay Resolution No. 11, series of 2010, of Pinsao Pilot Project Barangay, entitled ?A resolution requesting the implementation of naming roads within Pinsao Pilot Project Barangay.?\r\nb.   Barangay Resolution No. 10, series 2010, of Pinsao Pilot P', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research', '2nd', '2010-08-07', '0683-10', 'The naming or renaming of streets, plazas, public schools, buildings, bridges and other public places is subject to policies and guidelines prescribed by the National Heritage Institute and by the City of Baguio under Ordinance Numbered 29, series of 1991.  To ensure that said policies and guidelines be considered or to find justification of the proposed names, the Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research recommends that the proposed barangay resolutions be returned to the proponent with copies of the aforesaid guidelines for reference. (CR NR. 0683-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'returned to Pinsao Pilot Project Barangays thru Punong Barangay Arsenio L. Amdengan Jr., Baguio City, with copy of the guidelines prescribed by the National Historical Institue and by the City of Baguio under Ordinance Numbered 13-85 as amended by ordinance Numbered 29, series of 1991 for reference, to ensure that said policies and guidelines be considered or to find justification of the proposed names the proponent with copies of the aforesaid guidelines for reference (23 Aug 2010, 49)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the same committee, 1st Ind, 27 May 2010]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
