(431, '2010-04-03', '08:55:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'ASec. Celia S. Alba, Officer-in-Charge, Office of the Secretary General, Housing and Urban Development Coordinating Council (HUDCC)', '27 January 2010 of ASec. Celia S. Alba, Officer-in-Charge, Office of the Secretary General, Housing and Urban Development Coordinating Council (HUDCC) to then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., denying the request under Resolution No. 02, series of 2009', '-none-', '(NOTE:   Resolution No. 02, s. 2009 of East Quirino Hill Barangay, entitled ?requesting the issuance of a proclamation to declare parcels of land located at East Quirino Hill Extension, Block 7, Baguio City as socialized housing site?.)', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '3rd', '2010-08-03', '00259-10', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter BE RETURNED to the Barangay Council, East Quirino Hill Barangay, Baguio City, for appropriate information and action. Further recommends that proper protection, safety measures and plans be instituted within the barangay level considering that the area is already occupied.\r\n        Furthermore, for the Office of the City Executive, Baguio City to certify as priority project the relocation of the residents thereat. (CR NR. 00259-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'RETURNED to the Barangay Council, East Quirino Hill Barangay, Baguio City, for appropriate information and action. Further recommends that proper protection, safety measures and plans be instituted within the barangay level considering that the area is already occupied.\r\n        Furthermore, for the Office of the City Executive, Baguio City to certify as priority project the relocation of the residents thereat (22 Mar 2010, 52)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(432, '2010-04-03', '09:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Mark Nabus, President, Pico-Puguis Jeepney Operators and Drivers Association (PPJODA)', 'Letter dated 03 March 2010 of Mr. Mark Nabus, President, Pico-Puguis Jeepney Operators and Drivers Association (PPJODA) in behalf of the officers and members of PPJODA to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, requesting that members of their association be a', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '6th', '2010-08-03', '0453-10', 'With the foregoing reasons stated in its 2nd Indorsement dated 17 May 2010, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends to APPROVE that the BUHAGAN ROAD (formerly Bokawkan Road) be OPENED for the public utility jitneys associations with more than twenty units and observing the ?odd-even scheme?:\r\n           Further recommending to APPROVE that all public utility buses and vans-for-hire parked under a contract of lease or agreement with the Dangwa Terminal Compound or its leasing company be relocated to the Slaughter Terminal, Sto. Ni?o Barangay and only public utility jitneys be allowed to park and load/unload at the Dangwa Terminal Compound.\r\n           Recommending finally to APPROVE that all structures or shanties built at the Tabora Park area be demolished and prohibit any person from installing any structure or shanty for the purpose of trade, business or quarters.  The Tabora Park shall be converted as a staging area for all other public utility jitneys not accommodated at the Dangwa Terminal Compound. (CR NR. 0453-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation; Deferred (28 Jun 2010, 5c5)', '6th', '2010-08-07', 'Pending; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the same committee, 2nd Ind, 08 Mar 2010]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(433, '2010-04-03', '09:15:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0048-10 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?Urging all the barangays in the City of Baguio to appropriate at least five percent (5%) of their total budget appropriations for Gender and Development (GAD) programs pursuant to the pr', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A: Budget, Appropriations and Expenditures)', '3rd', '2010-07-07', '0513-10', 'The Committee on Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster A, reiterates its previous recommendation for APPROVAL as contained in the 2nd Indorsement dated 10 June 2010. (CR NR. 0513-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved - guidelines to be attached (19 Jul 2010, 15)', '3rd', '2010-07-07', 'Acted upon; Forwarded to the Committee on W&M (Cluster A) for study and recommendation (3rd Ind. 07 Jul 2010);', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
