(588, '2010-10-06', '04:55:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0081-10 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as ?Expressing the highest respect and profound gratitude of the City Government of Baguio to the officers and members of the Baguio Centennial Commission.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '1st', '2010-11-06', '00470-10', 'The Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends APPROVAL of the above proposed resolution and to include Dr. Charles L. Cheng-Chairman, Sports Events, Awards and Recognition and Mr. Jerry D. Salvosa-Commissioner. (CR NR. 00470-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (21 Jun 2010, 112)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(589, '2010-11-06', '11:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Federico G. Mateo', 'Letter dated 08 June 2010 of Mr. Federico G. Mateo, requesting consideration of his application for the transfer of rights over a parcel of lot located at Residence Section ?H?, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Baguio City, containing an area of 212 square me', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, 'UPLH-2013-040', 'After careful evaluation of the documents submitted by the applicant to support her application over the above stated parcel of land at the Baguio Workingmen\'s Village, the committee finds that the applicant substantially complied with all the essential requirements as provided for under City Ordinance Numbered 65, series of 1948, as amended.\r\n\r\nThe applicant submitted the following documents:\r\n\r\n1.  Sworn Application for occupancy and/or purchase of lot and/or cottage at the Workingmen\'s Village;\r\n2.  Pictures of improvements;\r\n3.  Lot plan;\r\n4.  Barangay Certification dated 20 April 2013 issued by David Puguon, Punong Barangay, Brookspoint Barangay, Baguio City certifying that Federico G. Mateo and Betty R. Talliad are the owner/s of a certain parcel located at Residence Section \"H\", Baguio City containing an area of 212 sq. mtrs.;\r\n5.  DENR-CENRO Certification dated 04 May 2010 of Julio L. Domogen, OIC, SISP, and attested by Amando I. Francisco, Land Management Officer III,and noted by Thomas L. Velasco, OIC, Office of the CENR Officer certifying that a parcel of land, containing an area of 212 sq. mtrs., more or less, located at Res. Sec. \'H\', Baguio City was found to be (1) outside previously plotted prior/subsisting Miscellaneous Sales Application (as of May 27, 2010), (2) Outside forest and military reservation; and (3) within Workingmen\'s Village covered by Exec. Proc. No. 358 dated September 17, 1938; and                                                                  6.  Certificate of Non-property dated 26 November 2013. \r\n\r\nIn view of all foregoing, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends approval of the application of Mr. Federico G. Mateo over that parcel of land at Baguio Workingmen\'s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City.\r\n\r\nThe committee further recommends that patenting the above parcel of land in favor of the above applicant be processed through Miscellaneous Sales Application (MSA) as provided for under R.A. 730. (UPLH-2013-040)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved, Res. No. 247, s. 2014 (22 September 2014, 19); Unfinished (15 September 2014, 19); Unfinished (08 September 2014, 22); Unfinished (18 August 2014, 23); Unfinished (11 August 2014, 21); Unfinished (04 August 2014, 24);Unfinished (28 July 2014, 25); Unfinished (14 July 2014, 36);Unfinished 07 July 2014, 48);Deferred (30 June 2014, 15); Unfinished (23 June 2014, 19); Unfinished (16 June 2014, 19); Unfinished (09 June 2014, 21); Unfinished (02 June 2014, 21);Unfinished (19 May 2014, 20); Unfinished (21 April 2014,Unfinished (31 March 2014, 23); Unfinished (24 Mar 2014, 41); Unfinished (17 Mar 2014, 42); Unfinished (10 Mar 2014, 43); Unfinished (03 Mar 2014, 47); Unfinished (09 Dec. 2013, 42)', '-none-', NULL, 'acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(590, '2010-11-06', '04:25:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0082-10 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?Requesting the Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) to fully implement in Baguio City, RA 6716 ?An act providing for the construction of water wells, rainwater collectors, deve', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Works', '1st', NULL, '0624-10', 'The Committee on Public Works recommends that the proposal be first referred to the Baguio Water District, Incorporated for the purpose of ascertaining the feasibility and necessity of ?construction of water wells, rainwater collectors, development of springs, and rehabilitation of existing water wells in all barangays in the Philippines.? (CR NR. 0624-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Baguio Water District thru Ms. Teresita P. de Guzman, General Manager, Baguio City, for the purpose of ascertaining the feasibility and necessity of ?the construction of water wells, rainwater collectors, development of springs, and rehabilitation of existing water wells in all barangays in the Philippines.?  (16 Aug 2010, 39)', '3rd', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(591, NULL, '10:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer', 'Letter dated 15 June 2010 of Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer, requesting approval for the transfer of Php150,000.00 appropriated under Account Code 840 (Repairs and Maintenance of Other Machineries) to Account Code 841 for the repair an', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A: Budget, Appropriations and Expenditures)', '1st', NULL, '0518-10', 'The Committee on Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster A, recommends APPROVAL of the foregoing request in accordance with the Local Government Code. (CR NR. 0518-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (26 Jul 2010, 3)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
