(599, NULL, '04:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Eduardo dela Cruz, et al., Baguio La Union Abra Transport Association, Inc., Baguio City', 'Letter dated 10 June 2010 of Mr. Eduardo dela Cruz, et al., Baguio La Union Abra Transport Association, Inc., Baguio City, requesting indorsement for the contract of lease they executed with Mr. Roy P. Tabanda for the use of a portion of the Burnham Park ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the letter dated 02 June 2010 of Mr. Eduardo M. dela Cruz, President, Baguio La Union Abra Transport Association, Inc. and assisted by their Legal Counsel Atty. George M. Dumawing, Jr., requesting assistance in connection with their application for new permit to engage in business of transportation at Burnham Park Caltex Service Station as their terminal area, which was forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation on 08 June 2010.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation for information', '1st', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(600, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', '-none-', 'Proposed Ordinance for the amendment of the policy and the details to implement or to carry out the recommendations of the Baguio Centennial Commission as embodied in the approved resolution adopting the draft resolution of the Baguio Centennial Commissio', '-none-', '(NOTE: The Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 005-10 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as ?Adopting the draft resolution of the Baguio Centennial Commission entitled ?A resolution recommending strategic actions for the rehabilitation and protection of watersheds and forest reservations as part of the centennial legacies of Baguio City ?  was converted into a resolution under Resolution Numbered 096, series of 2010, which was approved during the 26 April 2010 Regular Session.) (Item 36, 26 April 2010 Agenda)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '-none-', NULL, '00439-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be NOTED and be consolidated with the Environmental Code which is being crafted and studied upon by the committee as well as the different agencies of the City Government of Baguio to avoid repetition of the same ordinance. (CR NR. 00439-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'returned to the Committee for consolidation with the Environment Code which is being crafted and studied by the committee as well as the different agencies of the City Government of Baguio to avoid repetition of the same ordance (21 Jun 2010, 83)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(601, NULL, '02:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Letter dated 08 June 2010 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, submitting the names of those who sought financial assistance and the corresponding amounts collected and turned over to them in the total amount of P2,649,33:\r\n1.	Miguel Manansala for Baby Franz', '-none-', '-none-', 'furnished to the Hon. Members', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(602, NULL, '01:10:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Ordinance', 'Santo Tomas Proper Barangay', 'Barangay Ordinance No. 02, series of 2010, of Santo Tomas Proper Barangay, entitled ?Barangay ordinance stipulating the amount to be collected for clearances and fees of Santo Tomas Proper Barangay.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster C: Review of Barangay Budgets and Barangay Tax Ordinances; Accreditation of NGOs and other concerns)', '1st', NULL, 'BRGY-2017-077', 'The Committee on Barangay Affairs recommends APPROVAL pursuant to Section 57 (c) of the Local Government Code of 1991. (BRGY-2017-077).', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2017-05-06', 'Approved, Res. No. 205, s. 2017 (05 June 2017; 36).', '-none-', NULL, 'acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(603, NULL, '01:55:00', '-none-', 'Resolution', 'Municipality of Sablan, Benguet', 'Resolution No. 10-41 of the Municipality of Sablan, Benguet, entitled ?Resolution endorsing the proposed Engineered Sanitary Landfill of Baguio City at Sitio Alimang, Poblacion, Sablan, Benguet subject to the compliance of the requirements and conditions ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The letter dated 29 March 2010 of Mr. Santiago M. Bartolome, Secretary to the Sanggunian, Sablan, Benguet, transmitting the Sangguniang Bayan Resolution No. 10-30 of Sablan, Benguet, entitled ?Resolution disapproving the request of the City of Baguio for a favorable endorsement of their proposed Engineered Sanitary Landfill to be established in the Municipality of Sablan?, was returned to Mr. Santiago M. Bartolome, Secretary to the Sanggunian, Sablan, Benguet, with the information that during the 17 May 2010 Regular Session, the matter was noted per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '1st', NULL, '0931-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection recommends that the above be forwarded to Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana, Department Head, City Environment and Parks Management Office, for her comments and recommendations and thereafter submit to the City Council her report for their information and appropriate action.\r\n (CR NR. 0931-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'forwarded to Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana, Department Head, City Environment and Parks Management Office, for her comments and recommendations and thereafter submit to the City Council her report for their information and appropriate action (15 Nov 2010, 84)', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(604, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'residents and commuters of Bubon, Virac, Itogon, Benguet', 'Letter dated 28 April 2009 of the residents and commuters of Bubon, Virac, Itogon, Benguet requesting additional units for the transport of passengers and goods from Bubon to Baguio City and vice-versa.', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '4th', '2010-07-07', '0458-10', 'Primordial consideration in the grant of a certificate of convenience is the interest and welfare of the riding public.  The grant of a franchise to an applicant is espoused by the objective of public service.  Other pertinent and important requirements are technical in nature and left to the discretion of the approving office like the LTFRB and City Council.\r\n            In order that the welfare of the residents and commuters of Bubon, Virac, Itogon, Benguet be given action, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the herein listed applicants for the issuance of new franchises be EXEMPTED from the application of LTFRB MC No. 96-002 provided that their parking/loading area shall not be within the Central Business District. (CR NR. 0458-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwrded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 52b)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42');
