(630, NULL, '10:20:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Betty F. Fangasan, City Social Welfare and Development Officer', 'Letter dated 21 June 2010 of Ms. Betty F. Fangasan, City Social Welfare and Development Officer, requesting hiring of the following on casual basis for July to December 2010:\r\na.	Three (3) Social Welfare Officer I;\r\nb.	Two (2) Social Welfare Aide; and\r\nc.', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel', '2nd', NULL, '00484-10', 'The Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel recommends APPROVAL ON THE REQUEST OF Ms. Betty F. Fangasan, City Social Welfare and Development Officer, requesting hiring of the following on casual basis for July  to December 2010:\r\n           a.	Three (3) Social Welfare Officer I;\r\n           b.	Two (2) Social Welfare Aide; and\r\n           c.	One (1) Administrative Aide III.\r\n           Whose salaries and wages shall be charge to the personnel savings of the said office, provided that said office should strictly follow the process of hiring as  provided for under the Personnel Policies, Plans and Procedures, and Systems Handbook of the City Government of Baguio. (CR NR. 00484-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (28 Jun 2010, 74)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(631, NULL, '08:35:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, Hon. Erdolfo V. Balajadia and Hon. Joel A. Alangsab', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 0055-10 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, Hon. Erdolfo V. Balajadia and Hon. Joel A. Alangsab ?Providing for the Rules on receiving, docketing, assignment and raffling of Barangay Administrative Cases.?', '-none-', '(NOTE:  [a] Ordinance Numbered 100, series of 2009 provided for the rules on the conduct of hearing and other matters on disciplinary actions and administrative complaints against barangay officials; \r\n[b] FIRST READING ? Item 69, 28 June 2010 Agenda\r\n[c] SECOND READING AND FOR PUBLICATION BY POSTING ? 12 July 2010 Agenda     \r\n-  Posted in the bulletin boards of City Hall, City Public Market, Post Office, City Library and the Health Services Office starting 16 July 2010.)', 'Committee on Barangay Affairs', '1st', '2010-06-07', '0036-11', 'The Committee on Barangay Affairs recommends APPROVAL of the above proposed ordinance on SECOND READING AFTER PUBLICATION BY POSTING.\r\n  Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, Member of the Committee, signified ?Same comments. Is this an amendatory ordinance?  Should this not be contained in the IRR of the existing ordinance?? (CR NR. 0036-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved - Converted into a Resolution, IRR of Section 17 of Ordinance No. 100, Series of 2009; Res-017-2011; Realted Motion: Amending the Membership of SK, from De Vera to Yangot - Approved - Res-018-2011 (24 Jan 2011, 88)', '5th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
