(637, NULL, '02:05:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Ordinance', 'Upper General Luna Barangay', 'Barangay Ordinance No. 005, series of 2010, of Upper General Luna Barangay, entitled ?An ordinance prohibiting the existence of cars parked along the frontage of  Samson?s residence near City Lights at General Luna Road and all around the rotonda park fro', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '1st', '2010-06-07', '0833-10', 'Sangguniang Barangays do not possess the power to regulate traffic, instead of returning the above stated matter without City Council approval, the Committee shall treat the proposed barangay ordinance as a recommendation to the City Council to enact a City Ordinance relative to the traffic situation in Upper General Luna Barangay.\r\n         Wherefore, the Committee on Laws recommends that the attached Proposed Ordinance [PO 100-10] sponsored by the Committee, be approved on First Reading. (CR NR. 0833-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-08-11', 'the Barangay Ordinance was treated as recommendation to the City Council to enact a city ordinance relative to the traffic situation in Upper General Luna Barangay; returned the above stated matter without City Council approval (08 Nov 2010, 49)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon; Related to PO 100-10', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
