(666, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong, Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, Hon. Joel A. Alangsab and Hon. Antonio R. TaboraJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance of Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong, Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda, Hon. Joel A. Alangsab and then City Councilor Antonio R. Tabora Jr. ?Allowing owners of buildings and structures without building permit', '-none-', '(NOTE: a] The above proposed ordinance is the consolidated version of the related proposals of Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong, Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda and Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, resolutions, letters and pleas by the different barangays, residents and associations of the City of Baguio and that of the BENECO Board which all calls for a simplified policy and guidelines on electrical connections and water connections to buildings or structures built without building permit.\r\nb] The above proposed ordinance  was posted in the bulletin boards of the City Hall, City Public Market, Post Office, City Library and the Health Services Office starting 12 May 2009.\r\nc] The above proposed ordinance as amended was approved on Second Reading After Publication by Posting during the 06 july 2009 Regular Session.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '-none-', NULL, '776-09', 'The Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the above proposed ordinance as amended be APPROVED ON THIRD AND FINAL READING ON JOINT AND COLLECTIVE MOTION. (CR NR. 776-09)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Ord 67-09', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', 'Research', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
