(668, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda then Vice Mayor, Hon. Antonio R. TaboraJr., Hon. Galo D. Weygan, Hon. Nicasio M. AlipingJr. and former Councilors Hon. Elmer O. Datuin, Hon. Elmo M. Nevada, Hon. Edilberto B. Tenefrancia and Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 0093-2001 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda then Vice Mayor, then City Councilor Antonio R. Tabora Jr., then City Councilor Galo D. Weygan, Hon. Nicasio M. Aliping Jr. and former Councilors Hon. Elmer O. Datuin, then City Councilo', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above proposed ordinance was published in the Sun Star issue of 28 April 2002 and was also posted in the bulletin boards of the City Hall, City Public Market, Post Office and the City Health Office starting 29 April 2002.) (Item 18, 16 November 2009 Agenda)', 'Committee on Barangay Affairs', '-none-', NULL, '1139-09', 'The Committee on Barangay Affairs recommends that the above ordinance as amended be APPROVED on Third and Final Reading. (CR NR. 1139-09)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2009-07-12', 'Approved on Third and Final Reading', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', 'BLFT 2009', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
