(698, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Hon. Laendro B. YangotJr.', 'Letter of Intent of Coun. LBYangot Jr. volunteering his services to assist the AD HOC Committee assigned to take charge on the renegotiation of contract between the City Government of Baguio and Baguio Water District in the matter of Asin Mini Hydro Opera', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Utilities', '1st', NULL, '-none-', 'The Committee on Public Utilities, after further studies and considering that the City Mayor has already issued Administrative Order No. 27, series of 1996, naming Coun. LBYangot, Jr. as member of the Ad-Hoc Committee \"urging the Baguio Water District (BWD) to enter into a renegotiation of its contract with the City Government of Baguio for the operation, management and maintenance of Asin mini hydro electric plants? \" he being an elecrtical engineers, be noted being moot and academic.`', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted Upon', 'Asin Hydro', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
