(846, '2002-11-03', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Proposed Resolution', 'Hon. Richard A. Cari?o', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0049-2002 of Hon. Richard A. Cari?o, then City Councilor Elmo M. Nevada and Hon. Elmer O. Datuin (Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection) authorizing the City Mayor to enter into a Memorandum of', 'PR 0049-2002', 'The following were considered by the committee in coming up with the above proposal:\r\na.  Letter dated 10 July 2001 of Mr. Ruperto Alvar, Manager of the R&R Management and Sanitary Services offering their services to haul/collect the garbage of the city.\r\nb. 1st   Indorsement  dated  17  July 2001 forwarding  the  letter  of \r\nR& R Management and Sanitary Services to the Committee on Health, Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection.\r\nc. 2nd Indorsement dated 18 July 2001 forwarding the letter of R&R Management and Sanitary Services to Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer, for his comment and recommendation.\r\nd. 3rd Indorsement dated 19 July 2001 of Mr. Romeo D. Concio returning the matter to the Chairman of the Committee on Health, Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, with the attached copy of Mr. Romeo D. Concio\'s comment.\r\ne. Position Paper of the GSO, dated 08 August 2001 on the proposals of R&R Management and Sanitary Services and VCS Trucking on their proposal to haul and manage the disposal of garbage in the city.\r\nf. Letter of Intent for Proposed Garbage Management Services, dated 04 September 2001 from REN Transport  Corporation addressed to the City Mayor.\r\ng. 1st Indorsement dated 17 September 2001 from the Office of the City Mayor forwarding the letter of REN Transport Corporation to the Committee on Health, Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection.\r\nh. 1st Indorsement dated 17 September 2001om the Office of the City General Services Officer forwarding the letter of REN Transport Corporation to the Committee on Health, Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, further informing the committee that the said letter is the third offer they have received.  The two other offers earlier having come from R&R Management and Sanitary Services and VCS Trucking.\r\n\r\n***Taken up together with the Draft of the Terms of Reference submitted by Mr. Romeo D. Concio, GSO, Baguio City.', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '5th', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Lost', '11th', '2002-10-07', 'Proposals from the different private sector was considered by the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection and came up with Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0049-2002.  The above proposed resolution was converted into an ordinance during the 13 March 2002 Regular Session.  During the deliberation on Second Reading and For Publication, the said proposal was LOST.', 'Solid Waste Management', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
