(860, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Galo D. Weygan', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0080-2002 of Hon. Galo D Weygan making it a part of the Sangguninag Panlungsod House Rules that Committee Chairmen should endorse their Chairmanship to any of their members wheneer they go out of town on long durations of when t', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '1st', NULL, '-none-', 'The Committee on Laws recommends that the above resolution be simply NOTED as the proposal to endorse chairmanship to any member whenever they go out of town on long duration or when they go vacation  is presently in practice.  The Chairman and members as a matter of practice decides on any given issueforwarded to the committee and it is up to the chairman to forward the result of the deliberation to the council en banc.  No committee cahirman can monopolize a decision on a given issue as any issue is consulted en banc with the committee members', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2002-03-07', 'NOTED', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted Upon', 'Rules of Procedures', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
