(935, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Gloria Ysabel V. De Vera, Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong and Hon. Elaine D. Sembrano', 'Consolidated Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 063-03 and Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 036-05 adopted by Hon. Gloria Ysabel V. De Vera, then City Councilor Rocky Thomas A. Balisong and then City Councilor Elaine D. Sembrano, entitled \"Baguio City Youth Development C', '063-03', '-none-', 'Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development', '1st', NULL, '00174-10', 'Considering that the author is no longer a member of the City Council, the Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development hereby adopts as the author of the above-mentioned proposed ordinances.  Furthermore, considering that both proposed ordinances have the objectives and mechanism in common, both proposals are hereby consolidated.\r\n            The committee recommends approval of the proposed ordinance on SECOND READING and for PUBLICATION BY POSTING. (CR NR. 00174-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Consolidate PO 063-03 and PO 036-05 - returned to the Committee with the information that the above PO was posted in the bulletin boards starting 16 Mar 2010 - Approved on Second Reading and For Publication (15 Mar 2010, 14a)', '2nd', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
