(1148, '2004-02-08', '11:45:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 039-04 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr. \"identifying Rose Garden at Burnham Park as the Senior Citizen\'s Park in the City of Baguio.\"', 'Rose Graden Park', '-none-', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '1st', '2004-05-08', '07-091', 'The Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends approval of the following:1.	Rose Garden at Burnham Park be designated as ?Senior Citizens Park in the City of Baguio?;2.	Rose Garden be adopted under the ?Adopt a Park Policy? embodied in Resolution No. 16-89 and Ordinance No. 537, by the BARP Foundation Inc., pursuant to BOT Resolution No. 20, series of 2004, and Federation of Baguio Senior Citizens Association, Inc.; and3.	Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 39-04 of Hon. Leandro B. Yangot, Jr. identifying Rose Garden at Burnham Park as the Senior Citizens Park in the City of Baguio be APPROVED on Second Reading for Posting. (CR NR. 07-091)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2007-12-02', 'Back to Committee and for the committee to get the recommendation of the PTA, BPMC, CEPMO', '3rd', NULL, 'Pending.  Follow-Up letter of Prof Balanag, 1st Indorsment of Hon. Bautista attached to the documents', 'Hon. Leandro B. Yangot, Jr. 2007', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(1149, '2004-02-08', '11:45:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 040-04 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr. \"Providing for burial benefits for barangay officials and regular members of barangay tanod brigades in Baguio City and appropriating funds thereof.\" Adopted by the Committee on', '040-04', '-none-', 'Committee on Barangay Affairs', '1st', '2004-05-08', '08-959', 'Considering the noble intent of the ordinance seeking the support of the local government in addressing the concerns of the barangay particularly concerning the burial benefits of barangay officials, the Committee on Barangay Affairs recomends APPROVAL of the same subject to the availability of funds on SECOND READING AND FOR PUBLICATION BY POSTING.  By way of information burial  benefits for barangay officials have been made available thru voluntary contributions under the Barangay Mutual Aid Assisatnace Fund (BMAAF), an on going program of the Liga ng mga barangay- Baguio Chapter.  Thus, a counterpart fund from the City Government would immeasurably stengthen the onjectives of the said program.', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Back to Committee with the information that the matter was posted starting 04 July 2008.', '3rd', NULL, 'Pending', 'JAA 2008', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
(1150, '2004-02-08', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 041-04 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr. \"Prohibiting the detention of cadavers of deseased indigent patients in hospitals, clinics and other health care facilities and establishments on grounds of non-payment of hospi', '041-04', '-none-', 'Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor', '1st', '2004-05-08', '00411-10', 'The above matter is already addressed with the enactment of RA 9439 or the ?Patients\' Illegal Detention Act.?\r\nIn view of the above, the Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor respectfully recommends that the above proposal be NOTED.(CR NR. 00411-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 62)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
