(1490, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. E. Peter Ernst, et al of Concerned Residents of Outlook Drive North (CORESOLD-NORTH)', '1st Indorsement dated 18 October 2004 of then City Vice Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., forwarding the follow-up letter dated 11 October 2004 of Mr. E. Peter Ernst, et al., Concerned Residents of Outlook Drive North (CORESOLD-NORTH) regarding their six po', 'Petition', '(NOTE:  The aforementioned petition filed  by the CORESOLD-NORTH ( Concerned Residents of Outlook Drive North) in cooperation with Northern Heritage Tours, Inc. ?for sustainable, healthy future of natural surroundings on the eastern fringes of Baguio City, in particular areas MINES VIEW, OUTLOOK DRIVE, GOOD SHEPHERD, in order to preserve them for posterity, as an international grade tourist and retirement attraction/destination? was forwarded to the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection [old] on 19 February 2004 and later forwarded to the  Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection [new] on 09 July 2004.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '2nd', NULL, '0155-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons forwarded the matter to the former City Mayor Braulio D. Yaranon, for his information and appropriate action on 16 November 2004. However, since then, no action has been taken by that office. It is therefore recommended that the Office of the City Mayor be urged to act on the same and thereafter report it to the committee for proper action. (CR NR. 0155-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Returned to the Office of the Honorable City Mayor, Baguio City, for said office to act on the same and thereafter report it to the committee for appropriate action (1 Mar 2010, 73)', '4th', '2010-09-03', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
