(1595, '2005-04-01', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Faustino A. Olowan', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 003-05 of then City Councilor Faustino A. Olowan\"creating a task force to look into City Government owned and administered lots occupied or being used by private individuals for possible segregation, clearing or lease which ever', '003-05', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', '2005-05-01', '0789-10', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends APPROVAL of the above proposed resolution with the following amendments:\r\n     1. that the title and the resolutory portion be amended to delete the phrase ?within 60 days? and to read as follows:  ?Creating a task force to look into city government owned and administered lots, BUILDINGS AND OTHER PROPERTIES occupied or being used by private individuals for possible segregation, clearing or lease whichever is most applicable and to submit said findings and recommendation TO THE OFFICE OF THE CITY MAYOR AND THE SANGGUNIANG PANLUNGSOD FOR APPROPRIATE ACTION.?\r\n     2. that the ?Whereas? clauses be amended accordingly to include the phrase ?BUILDINGS AND OTHER PROPERTIES?.\r\n     3. that the membership of the task force be amended to include the offices of the City General Services Officer and the City Treasurer.\r\n            Further, the committee members adopt to be the authors of the above proposed resolution considering that the proponent is no longer a member of the City Council. (CR NR. 0789-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Deferred - returned to committee for further study and to consider the observations of the Honorable Members during the 21 February2011 Regular Session (21 Feb 2011, 4)', '3rd', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
