(1638, '2005-06-01', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 009-05 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr. \"Favorably indorsing the clamor of he actual occupant/residents of Camp Allen barangay for the awarding of the lots they are occupying in their favor.\"', '009-05', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', '2005-07-01', '0154-11', 'The subject of the above proposed resolution is over a portion of a Military Reservation covered by Proclamation No. 254, series of 1928 and TCT No. 1390 in the name of the then Philippine Constabulary, aggregately known as the Camp Henry T. Allen Military Reservation.  Segregating any portion thereof for purposes other than that which is intended needs to undergo the process as prescribed by law. \r\nIn consideration thereof, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter BE FORWARDED to the Housing and Urban Development Coordinating Council for appropriate action or pre-proclamation evaluation pursuant to Memorandum Circular No. 157 ?Prescribing guidelines, procedures and timeframes in the conduct of evaluation, complete staff work (CSW) and approval of proposed proclamations for housing purposes?, prior to any further action. (CR NR. 0154-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2011-07-03', 'FORWARDED to His Excellency Jejomar C. Binay, Vice President, Republic of the Philippines and Chairman, Housing and Urban Development Coordinating Council (HUDCC), 9th Floor BDO Plaza, Paseo De Roxas, Makati City, for appropriate action or pre-proclamation evaluation pursuant to Memorandum Circular No. 157 ?Prescribing guidelines, procedures and timeframes in the conduct of evaluation, complete staff work (CSW) and approval of proposed proclamations for housing purposes?, prior to any further action.\r\nThe subject of the above proposed resolution is over a portion of a Military Reservation covered by Proclamation No. 254, series of 1928 and TCT No. 1390 in the name of the then Philippine Constabulary, aggregately known as the Camp Henry T. Allen Military Reservation. Segregating any p[ortion thereof for purpose other than that which is intended needs to undergo the process as prescribed by law. (7 Mar 2011, 83)', '7th', '2011-09-03', 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
