(1924, '2005-11-03', '02:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leonardo Q. Bayan Jr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 027-05 of then City Councilor Leonrado Q. Bayan Jr. \"Creating the Physical Fitness and Sports development Council (PFSDC) of Baguio City.\"', '027-05', '(NOTE:   FIRST READING ? 21 March 2005)', 'Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development', '1st', NULL, '0641-10', 'The Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development recommends APPROVAL of the proposed ordinance on SECOND READING AND FOR POSTING of the above mentioned proposal, as follows:\r\n        Section 1.   This ordinance shall be entitled the Physical Fitness and Sports Development Council (PFSDC) of Baguio City, which shall act as the local organizational network to assist the Philippine Sports Commission in planning, information dissemination, and actual implementation and monitoring of the national policy and program of ?SPORTS FOR ALL? and shall be composed of the following:\r\n              City Mayor                            -      Chairman\r\n              PNP Representatives          -      Vice Chairman\r\n              DepEd Division Supervisor -      Secretary General\r\n              DILG Representative           -       Member\r\n              ABC President                     -       Member\r\n              SK Federation President     -      Member\r\n              CHED Representative          -      Member\r\n              TESDA Representative        -      Member\r\n              (2) NGO Representatives     -      Members\r\n              City Development Officer    -      Member\r\n(CR NR. 0641-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'APPROVAL of the proposed ordinance on SECOND READING AND FOR POSTING - returned to the Committee with the information that the above proposed ordinance was posted in the bulletin boards of City Hall, City Public Market, City Library and the Health Services Office starting 17 August 2010 (16 Aug 2010, 53)', '6th', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
