(1952, '2005-04-04', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Final Report', 'Comprehensive Sports Development Program', 'Final Report: Towards the Finalization of Comprehensive Sports Development Program for the City of Baguio.', 'Sports Development Program', '-none-', 'Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development', '1st', '2005-11-04', '0762-10', 'The Committee on Youth Welfare and Sports Development recommends the following:\r\n     a. That the matter be returned to the Office of the City Sports Development Office for update, amendment or revision, considering that other provisions of items in the report are moot and academic or are inapplicable to the present condition of sports development of the City of Baguio.\r\n     b. That a sufficient amount be appropriated for the conduct of a Sports Summit from the any available fund of the Sports Development Fund, which shall be a tool in gathering pertinent data for the amendment, revision or updating of the matter. (CR NR. 0762-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to Atty. Carlos M. Canilao, city Administrator, Office for City Administration, Baguio City, Attention: Sports and Recreation Division, with the request for update, amendment or revision, considering that other provisions of items in the report are moot and academic or are inapplicable to the present condition of sports development of the City of Baguio.\r\nFurther, a sufficient amount be appropriated for the conduct of a Sports Summit from any available fund of the Sports Development Fund, which shall be a tool in gathering pertinent data for the amendment, revision or updating of the matter.\r\nAttached is the recommendation of the Committee (27 Sep 2010, 26)', '3rd', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
