(1991, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 115-05 of Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez ?Requesting the City Environment and Parks Management Office (CEPMO) to prepare a plan for the establishment of an ?avenue of flags? in front of the Baguio City Hall.?', '115-05', '(NOTE: The letter dated 11 March 2005 of Ms. Dinah L. Villanueva, President, Vallejo Sister City Association, Inc. to Honorable City Mayor Braulio D. Yaranon regarding the hoisting of sister cities? flags in front of City Hall (avenue of flags) and the Baguio Obelisk Project was forwarded to then Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds on 13 April 2005.)', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '1st', NULL, '0723-10', 'The Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends to reiterate the recommendation of then Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds as contained in their 4th Indorsement dated 13 May 2005 recommending APPROVAL of the proposed resolution and moves to adopt the recommendation of Arch. Josephine B. Chan, OIC then of the City Environment and Parks Management Office (CEPMO) that the avenue of flags be instead located at the Baguio Convention Center where existing flagpoles are already located.  This is to prevent any further expense to the city. (CR NR. 0723-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-08-11', 'Deferred - returned to committee for further study and to consider the manifestations and suggestions of the Honorable Members during the 08 November 2010 Regular Session (08 Nov 2010, 11)', '7th', '2010-12-11', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
