(2085, '2005-10-08', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, City Treasurer', '1st Indorsement dated 03 August 2005 of Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, City Treasurer, requesting appropriate action on the following:\r\n      1. Unpaid rental of the BAMARVA and BAMARVEMPCO to the city for that area where their building is erected at the Baguio C', 'Business Taxes', '-none-', 'Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce', '2nd', '2005-11-08', '0639-10', 'The Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce recommends to FORWARD the above requests to the City Treasurer?s Office for comment/s and/or recommendation/s.\r\n            BAMARVA has been DISSOLVED as a corporation when its corporate term expired on September 20, 2005. Since 2009, BAMARVACO has occupied the building previously occupied by BAMARVA.\r\n            The City Treasurer is requested to submit an assessment of the liabilities on unpaid rental of BAMARVA and BAMARVACO, if any.\r\n            Lastly, the City Treasurer is requested to submit a report containing her findings on whether or not the subject building is being used solely as an office of BAMARVACO of if commercial spaces are being leased out. (CR NR. 0639-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-09-08', 'FORWARDED to the City Treasurer\'s Office thru Ms. Thelma B. Manaois, City Treasurer, Baguio City, for comment/s and/or recommendation/s. The City Treasurer is requested to submit an assessment of the liabilities on unpaid rental of BAMARVA and BAMARVACO, if any and a report containing her findings on whether or not the subject building is being used solely as an office of BAMARVACO or if commercial spaces are being leased out (09 Aug 2010, 76a)', '6th', '2010-11-08', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
