(2122, '2005-12-10', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'legitimate stallholders and members of the Fish Section Association', 'Letter dated 04 October 2005 of the legitimate stallholders and members of the Fish Section Association, Carinderia Building, City Market, strongly objecting the application of Ms. Cecilia Centeno and Ms. Raquel Quiteves to convert into stalls the space b', 'Fish Section', '(NOTE: The letter dated 21 September 2005 of ms. Raquel Quiteves and Ms. Cecilia Centeno, seeking assistance of their application to lease stalls beneath the stairs of the Fish Section of the Carinderia Building at the Baguio City Market was forwarded to the Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce on 27 September 2005.)', 'Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce', '1st', NULL, '0544-10', 'The Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce recommends that the letters as found in (a) and (b) above BE NOTED for the following reasons:\r\n1. The requested area is an unloading area for bulk fish deliveries (?bagsakan?) and a common passageway for vendors and buyers.  To award this space would result to constriction of the area causing pedestrian traffic, lack of ?bagsakan? area and endanger market goers in case of emergencies;\r\n2. A similar request made by Shirley Aquino, represented by Mr. Ilalo Cardinal was recommended to be NOTED, after the Sangguniang Panlungsod failed to override it.  Thereby, there is equal application of the law to all applicants covering the subject area. (CR NR. 0544-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (26 Jul 2010, 29b)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
