(2157, NULL, '02:01:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation', 'Letter dated 15 March 2010 of Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, regarding the following:\r\n     a. reiterating their position to pursue their previous propo', '-none-', '(NOTE:  a.]   The following  were returned to Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, with the information that the matters were noted, per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons, approved in the 30 March 2009  and 02 February 2009 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio:\r\n              a.    Letter dated 04 March 2009 of  Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President & CEO, ACE Technologies , Holdings & Development Corporation  to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, requesting facilitation of funding and approval by the City Council regarding  their proposal (as re-amended) through negotiated procurement for the design, rehabilitation (extended serviceability) and final closure of the existing Irisan open dumpsite facility.\r\n                          b.    Faxed letter  dated 26 February 2009 of Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President & CEO, ACE Technologies , Holdings & Development Corporation  to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, inquiring on the status of their proposal through negotiated procurement for the design, rehabilitation, extended serviceability, and final closure of the existing Irisan Open Dumpsite Facility dated 09 January 2009 and reiterating their intention to serve the best interest for the City of Baguio.\r\n                           c.	      Letter dated 22 December 2008 of Mr. Ruben H. Luyon, Director, Ace Technologies, Holding & Development Corporation, requesting that they be allowed to conduct a replay of their 03 November 2008 presentation of their amended proposal dated 31 October 2008 through negotiated procurement for the design, rehabilitation, extended serviceability, and final closure of the existing Irisan Open Dumpsite Facility; and\r\n                          d.   Letter dated 09 January 2009 of  Mr. Johnny N. Chotrani, President and CEO, ACE Technologies, Holdings & Development Corporation to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, reiterating their proposal to responsibly perform the rehabilitation of the Irisan dumpsite and requesting the prompt release of the Notice to Proceed (NTP) including the initial P14,000,000.00 payment for the project. This proposal supersedes their October 31, 2008 and November 3, 2008 proposals.)\r\n               b]       Res. No. 480, s. 2009 requested the City Environment and Parks Management Office (CEPMO) to prepare and submit with discussion and recommendation, a brief of each of the systems of solid waste management which were submitted to the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council).)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '2nd', NULL, '00296-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be NOTED considering that the Technical Working Group of the Solid Waste Management is coming up with the final evaluation of all the proposals submitted to them. (CR NR. 00296-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-12-04', 'NOTED (12 Apr 2010, 48)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
