(2164, NULL, '04:55:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'officers/operators/drivers of the  different jeepney associations', 'Letter dated 02 March 2010 of the officers/operators/drivers of the  different jeepney associations, requesting immediate action to stop the implementation/cancellation of Ordinance No. 33, series of 2009.', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Ord. No. 33, s. 2009 declared it unlawful for Public Utility Buses (PUBs) and Jitneys (PUJs), vans for hire including freight trucks and other vehicles of similar nature, such as trucks masquerading as jeeps, to park or to use any portion of Abanao Street, Chanum Street, Governor Pack Road, Harrison Road, Otek Street, and Tabora Park (along Magsaysay Avenue), including any road, street, right-of-way, plaza, park and other public place as terminal parking space or loading and unloading areas for passengers and goods.)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', NULL, '00324-10', 'The Committee on Laws recommends that the above matter be NOTED, considering that Ordinance No. 33, series of 2009 was already amended and approved in the City Council?s Regular Session held on 22 February 2010 as Ordinance Numbered 08, series of 2010 entitled ?Amending Ordinance Numbered 33, series of 2009.? (CR NR. 00324-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (26 Apr 2010, 59)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:42'),
