(2390, NULL, '11:36:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Shirley Adian', 'Letter dated 24 January 2007 of Ms. Shirley Adian to then City Councilor Faustino A. Olowan,   submitting her lot application at Res. Sec. ?H?, Int. Evangelista St., Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Baguio City, with an area of 291 sq. meters.', 'Lot Application', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '2nd', NULL, 'CR NR. 08-1628', 'The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing REITERATES APPROVAL of the above application as contained in its 5th Indorsement dated 08 August 2008. The amended area was due to the fact that upon verification by the DENR, only 62 square meters of the lot applied for falls within Executive Proclamation No. 358 dated 17 September 1938 or the Baguio Workingmen?s Village. (CR NR. 08-1628);           The Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing REITERATES APPROVAL of the above application as contained in its 5th Indorsement dated 08 August 2008 subject to strict compliance with recommendations of the Mines and Geosciences Bureau, DENR-CAR in its Memorandum Report dated 09 May 2008 in answer to the statement of Hon. Nicasio S. Palaganas. (CR NR. 08-1515); Subject lot is an excess lot of the Baguio Workingmen?s Village, located particularly at Int. Evangelista St., West Bayan Park Barangay, Baguio City with an area of 291 square meters.\r\n        It is a vacant lot adjacent to a residential structure built by the applicant.\r\n        Having been qualified and satisfied the requirements as provided for by  City Ordinance No. 65-48 as amended, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends APPROVAL of the above application with an amended area of 62 square meters.\r\n         Attached hereto are the memorandum from the City Planning and Development Office, the City Engineering Office, the Ocular Geological Investigation of the lot, and the corrected lot plan for further reference and guidance. (CR NR. 08-1182, 22 Aug. 2008)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Res 016-09', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted Upon', 'Research', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
