(2411, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Sebnangen Galong, members of Baro Nga Pagtaengan Ti Umili, Inc.', 'Letter dated 09 July 2007 of Mr. Sebnangen Galong, et al., members of Baro Nga Pagtaengan Ti Umili, Inc. and occupants of parcels of land along Baguio-Tuding Road, Baguio City to Hon. Isabelo B. Cosalan Jr., seeking His Honor?s support for the declaration', 'Socialized Housing Site', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '2nd', NULL, '465-09', 'The subject of the above request is a parcel of land covered by TCT Nos. T-36310 and T-36311 in the name of Roman A. Cruz Jr. and containing a total area of 3,528 square meters. Said lots were sequestered by the National Government and currently under the possession of the Presidential Commission on Good Government.\r\n            In view thereof, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends the following:\r\n1.	 TO SUPPORT the request of the Baro Nga Pagtaengan Ti Umili, Inc. for the declaration of the above properties of Socialized Housing purposes for the City of Baguio subject to existing laws and the recommendation of the Mines and Geosciences Bureau in its Memorandum dated 23 March 2009.\r\n2.    TO ENDORSE FOR APPROVAL by the Presidential Commission on Good Government of said request.\r\n             Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda,   Member of the Committee,  signified ? - Am in favor of declaration of site for socialized housing but not for a specific group. - area should not be allocated by any organization.? (CR NR. 465-09)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', 'Lands 2009', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
