(2441, NULL, '02:45:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Ordinance', 'Trancoville Barangay', 'Barangay Ordinance Number 02-11, series of 2005, of Trancoville Barangay ?imposing a fine of Five Pesos per square meter annually to owners of titled property that remains to be title vacant lands up to the present located within Barangay Trancoville.?', 'Brgy Ord 02-011-05', '-none-', 'Committee on Barangay Affairs', '1st', NULL, '0438-12', 'The Committee on Barangay Affairs recommends that the matter be RETURNED to the barangay without Council action for the incumbent officials to determine if they will adopt or modify the said ordinance. Furthermore, private properties are subject to the will of the owner on how they intend to use such property for as long as it is not in violation of any law, and that such owners cannot be sanctioned for non-utilization of their own property. (CR NR. 0438-12)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'RETURNED to Punong Barangay Angelina A. Bucasan, Trancoville Barangay, Baguio City, without Council action and for the incumbent officials to determine if they will adopt or modify the said ordinance. Furthermore, private properties are subject to the will of the owner on how they intend to use such property for as long as it is not in violation of any law, and that such owners cannot be sanctioned for non-utilization of their own property (13 Aug 2012, 50);', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
