(2598, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Citizen\'s Forum', 'Ms. Merlyn Palaganas', 'Advance Notice to avail of the Citizen\'s Forum of the Baguio Mantas Swim Club represented by Ms. Merlyn Palaganas re: possible amendments to Section 2 of City Ordinance No. 34, series of 2004.', '-none-', '(NOTE:  [a]  The letter dated 03 March 2010 of Ms. Merlyn Palaganas, President, Baguio Mantas Swim Club, Baguio City, asking consideration for the amendment of City Ordinance No. 34, series of 2004, since most of the swimmers are children who attend classes from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. was forwarded to the Committee on Laws on 12 March 2010; and\r\n[b] Ordinance No. 34, series of 2004 established the general guidelines for the management operation and maintenance of the swimming pool complex at the Baguio Athletic Bowl.)', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', 'In her Honor?s 2nd Indorsement dated 22 March 2010, Hon. Elaine D. Sembrano reports out that the matter being requested for by the private proponents has already been granted by the Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista, Jr., upon due representation made and in coordination with the City Sports Coordinator Mr. Fidelino Villafuerte as indicated in the attached Memorandum Order issued March 16, 2010.', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (22 Mar 2010, 68)', '1st', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
