(2600, NULL, '08:50:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Richard de Guzman', 'Letter dated 15 March 2010 of Mr. Richard De Guzman, submitting documents for the transfer of rights of Lot No. 49, Block 8, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City, with an area of 250 square meters, from his mother Ms. Francisca P. De Guzm', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, '0516-10', 'In view of the waiver of rights of a parcel of land including improvements thereon executed between and among Francisca P. De Guzman and her children as well as the satisfaction of requirements pursuant to Ordinance No. 65-48 as amended, the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the award of Lot 49, Block 8, Baguio Workingmen?s Village, Aurora Hill, Baguio City to Francisca P. De Guzman be cancelled and the same BE AWARDED to her children namely:\r\n1. Ricky M. De Guzman\r\n2. Marites M. De Guzman\r\n3. Rolando M. De Guzman\r\n4. Marivel M. De Guzman\r\n5. Richard M. De Guzman\r\n6. Rinie M. De Guzman\r\nAttached hereto are the Memorandum from the Office of the City Planning and Development Coordinator and pictures of improvements for further information and guidance.\r\n (CR NR. 0516-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved (19 Jul 2010, 18)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
