(2714, NULL, '04:55:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Tomasito D. Calasicas', 'Letter dated 19 March 2010 of Mr. Tomasito D. Calasicas, in behalf of the Barangay Council and the residents of Cabinet-Hill Teachers? Camp Barangay, requesting to avail of the Citizens Forum on 22 March 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  [a] Resolution No. 150, s. 2009 resolved that the Department of Public Works and Highways-Cordillera Administrative Region (DPWH-CAR) will suspend its activities in relation to the construction of a training center at the old basketball court area at Cabinet Hill Barangay, Baguio City in the meantime pending its submission of the demolition order for existing structures and building permit for the construction of a training center in the same area.	\r\n[b]  Resolution No. 149, s. 2009 requested the Department of Public Works and Highways-Cordillera Administrative Region (DPWH-CAR) to submit to the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council)the demolition order and building permit in connection with the construction of a training center at the old basketball court area at Cabinet Hill Barangay, Baguio City.\r\n[c]    Resolution No. 129, s. 2009 called on the Regional Director of the Department of Public Works and Highways-Cordillera Administrative Region to cease and desist from undertaking construction activities for a training center building at the old basketball court in Barangay Cabinet Hill pending resolution of issues raised by the residents;\r\n[d] The following personalities were requested to be present in today?s meeting:\r\n                1. Engr. Enrico F. Guilaf, Regional Director, DPWH-CAR, to clarify issues on the above stated letter; and\r\n                2.  the barangay officials of the Cabinet Hill-Teachers? Camp Barangay to discuss matters relative to their predicament as brought out by Mr. Tomasito D. Calasicas with the DPWH-CAR for not adhering with the agreement to construct a basketball court at the topmost floor of the five (5) storey National Training Center Building at Cabinet Hill, Baguio City.)', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', '2010-08-04', '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-05-04', 'Forwarded to the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing for the committee to assist the barangay in coming out with possible solution to their problem (5 Apr 2010, 7)', '1st', '2010-08-04', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
