(2721, NULL, '11:15:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Resolution', 'Teodora Alonzo Barangay', 'Barangay Resolution Numbered 06, series of 2010, of Teodora Alonzo Barangay, entitled ?A resolution requesting for the re-alignment of the calamity fund coming from City Development Fund (CDF) of Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr. amounting to Three Hundred T', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Works', '1st', NULL, '0637-10', 'The Committee on Public Works recommends that the approval of the request of Teodora Alonzo Barangay ?to realign the calamity fund coming from City Development Fund (CDF) of Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr. amounting to Three Hundred Thousand Pesos (Php300,000.00) as a calamity allocation and aid intended for Teodora Alonzo Barangay?, it appearing that such realignment is the wish of Teodora Alonzo Barangay as manifested in its Resolution Numbered 06, series of 2010, that being the wish of the barangay, as evidenced by attached Resolution Numbered 06, series of 2010.\r\n        The committee further recommends that its docket be cleared thereof and the matter be returned to the City Secretary, Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, for his referral to the appropriate departments/offices of the city government in order that the immediate implementation of the project may be put in motion. (CR NR. 0637-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Approved; Ord-55s2010 (23 Aug 2010, 30)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
