(2726, NULL, '04:05:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Dir. Julius Torres, Director IV, Commission on Elections-CAR', 'Letter dated 22 March 2010 of Dir. Julius Torres, Director IV, Commission on Elections-CAR, regarding Resolution No. 019, series of 2010 and informing the Honorable  Members of the City Council that during the October 2007 Barangay and Sangguniang Kabataa', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Resolution No. 019, s. 2010 inquired from the COMELEC-CAR, Baguio City, why the public school teachers who served during the 2007 Barangay and Sangguniang Kabataan (SK) elections were not yet paid despite the lapse of time and requesting the immediate payment of their compensation for the services rendered by the concerned teachers during the said elections.)', 'furnished to the Hon. Members & Research Div. (attach as supp. doc. to Res. No. 019, s. 2010), Dep-Ed-CAR & City Treasurer?s Office', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2727, NULL, '04:30:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Quintin P. San Diego', 'Letter dated 05 March 2010 of Mr. Quintin P. San Diego to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, stating among others his proposal for the establishment of a casino in Baguio City.', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Laws', '1st', NULL, '0447-10', 'The Committee on Laws recommends that the above stated matter be NOTED.\r\n	Hon. Nicasio M. Aliping, Jr., Member of the Committee, signified ?denied not noted?. (CR NR. 0447-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 91)', '3rd', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2728, NULL, '09:30:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Magdalena Tindowen, et al.', 'Letter dated 16 March 2010 of Ms. Magdalena Tindowen, et al., seeking assistance and intervention for the proper investigation on the closure of  road right-of-way at the adjacent lot of JM Dominguez Agronomic Company, Inc., San Luis Village Barangay, Bag', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '2nd', NULL, '00375-10', 'Subject of the petition is a private subdivision road lot within the JM Dominguez Subdivision, San Luis Village, Baguio City previously used by the interior residents as access to their respective homes. In order that the issue on right of way be effectively addressed, the management of the JM Dominguez Subdivision requested the petitioners to organize themselves into an association with whom the management of the subdivision can enter into an agreement with for the use of its subdivision road, peace and order as well as the cleanliness within the subject premises.\r\n       Having been organized through the assistance of the committee and the Barangay Council of San Luis village Barangay and with the ongoing registration of their association with the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter BE NOTED. (CR NR. 00375-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 51)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43');
