(2729, NULL, '09:45:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Resolution', 'Happy Hallow Barangay', 'Barangay Resolution Number 10-03, series of 2010, of Happy Hallow Barangay, entitled ?Resolution requesting the Honorable Members of the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council) to please reconsider its deferment action as endorsed by the Committee on Educat', '-none-', '(NOTE: The above matter is related to the following:\r\na. Letter dated 25 August 2009 of Dr. Elma D. Donaal, Ed. D., Secondary School Principal IV, Baguio City National High School, requesting deferment of the request for change of name of Happy Hallow School Rizal Annex to Canuto Memorial High School, for the reasons mentioned therein, which was returned to Dr. Elma D. Donaal, Ed. D., Secondary School Principal IV, Baguio City National High School, Baguio city, with the information that her request for deferment for the change of name of Happy Hallow School Rizal Annex to Canuto memorial High School was granted during the 26 October 2009 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, per recommendation of the Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research;\r\nb. Letter dated 01 June 2009 of  Dr. Ellen B. Donato, Ed. D., CESO V, Schools Division Superintendent and Co-Chairman, Local School Board, DepEd-Division of Baguio City to Hon. Fred L. Bagbagen, submitting the request for change of name ? Happy Hallow School Rizal Annex to Canuto Memorial High School, as unanimously agreed upon  during the May 15, 2009 meeting  by the members of the Local School Board, which was previously forwarded to the Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research on 19 June 2009; and\r\nc. Barangay Ordinance No. 08-05, series of 2008, of Happy Hallow Barangay, entitled ?An ordinance proposing for the change of name of the Happy Hallow High School Rizal Annex to Canuto Memorial High School in memory of Mr. Ngoay Canuto, the donor of the lot for the school site?, which was forwarded to Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., Chairman, City School Boards, Baguio City, per recommendation of the Committee on Laws, acted upon during the 12 January 2009 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio.)', 'Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research', '1st', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
