(2820, NULL, '02:55:00', '-none-', 'Faxed letter', 'Mr. Cesar C. Morales, Secretary/HHRO II, Housing and Land Use Regulatory Board-CAR', 'Faxed letter dated 23 March 2010 of Mr. Cesar C. Morales, Secretary/HHRO II, Housing and Land Use Regulatory Board-CAR, regarding the following:\r\n         a.    acknowledging receipt of a copy of the 5th Indorsement dated 17 March 2010, of the City Secret', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the 1st Indorsement dated 19 March 2008 of Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista, Jr. to Hon. Councilor  Isabelo B. Cosalan, Jr., forwarding the letter dated 17 March 2008 of Ms. Rebecca F. Torres, Regional Officer, HLURB, informing that the agreement between Lexber, Inc. and Home Guaranty Corporation (HGC) has been terminated and a criminal case had been filed against Alejandro Cruz-Herrera, for the project located within Eagle Crest Subdivision and requesting  the following:\r\n                     a)	The city does not further issue any Locational Clearance/Building Permits to develop the (260) lots involved; and \r\n                     b)	The city consider the above circumstance in its action on the application for Alteration of Plan (if any) of the re-subdivided lots subject of the agreement between the HGC and Lexber, Inc.\r\n           which was forwarded to the Office of the City Planning and Development Coordinator and the City Buildings and Architecture Office, for appropriate information and guidance, per  recommendation of the Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing, acted upon during the 15 March 2010 Regular Session.)', 'furnished to the Honorable Members, Administrative & Research Divisions', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
