(2822, NULL, '09:15:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Aristeo L. Castillo, Chairman, BlueMedia Communications,', 'Letter dated 22 March 2010 of Mr. Aristeo L. Castillo, Chairman, BlueMedia Communications, to then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., submitting their proposal for the supply, delivery and installation of Broadband Network and Surveillance Security Syst', '-none-', '(NOTE: Res. No. 051, s. 2010 approved the recommendations, as amended of the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation in its 2nd Indorsement dated 05 March 2010 relative to the presentations made by BlueMedia Communications and  Headline I & E Trading Corporation.)', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '2nd', NULL, '00332-10', 'In view of the reasons stated in its 3rd Indorsement dated 13 April 2010, the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the Technical Working Group speed-up the preparation of the Terms of Reference and that the City Mayor furnish the Sangguniang Panlungsod a copy of the contract entered with (any of) the proponent(s). (CR NR. 00332-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Office of the Honorabel City mayor, Attention: The Technical Working Group, Baguio City, to speed up the preparation of the Terms of Reference and that the Honorable City Mayor furnish the Sangguniang Panlungsod a copy of the contract entered with (any of) the proponent(s) (17 May 2010, 35)', '4th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
