(2837, NULL, '10:55:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 0030-10 of then City Councilor Rocky Thomas A. Balisong ?Prohibiting the parking of vehicles along the roads and streets at Purok 2 to Purok 5 and Purok 10, Sto. Tomas Road, Dontogan Barangay from 7:00 am to 8:00 pm.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '1st', '2010-06-04', '00328-10', 'The Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends to APPROVE the herein proposed ordinance. (CR NR. 00328-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'APPROVED on SECOND READING and for PUBLICATION (7 Jun 2010, 23)', '-none-', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2838, NULL, '10:55:00', '-none-', 'PR', 'Hon. Rocky Thomas A. Balisong', 'Proposed Resolution Nr. PR 0062-10 of then City Councilor Rocky Thomas A. Balisong ?Recommending the use of that space, formerly main gate of the John Hay Air Base, along Loakan Road as the staging area of the PMA-Kias Transport Association subject to cer', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation', '1st', NULL, '00331-10', 'The PMA-Kias Jeepney Transport Association is amenable to pay the required fee and other conditions as may be required by the City of Baguio for the use of that area.\r\n       The Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation recommends that the proposed resolution be APPROVED whereby that space formerly the main gate of Camp John Hay be used as the staging area for the PMA-Kias Jeepney Transport Association.\r\n       Hon. Antonio R. Tabora Jr., Member of the Committee, signified ?What are the Terms of Reference??. (CR NR. 00331-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Public Utilities, Transportation and Traffic Legislation for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 25a)', '3rd', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2839, NULL, '02:15:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', 'Letter dated 23 March 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., requesting information on the status of their request for the concurrence of the appointment of Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana as City Government Department Head II, City Environment and P', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel', '1st', NULL, '00290-10', 'The Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel recommends two things: First, that the City legal Officer be requested to be present during the City Council Regular Session on April 5, 2010 to help the council in deciding its final action because the deferment suspends the fifteen days (15) given to the City Council to act posting or negatively on the appointment. Second, the committee recommends the appointment should be voted upon and let the result of the voting tell the final action of the City Council.\r\n     On the other hand if the opinion of the City Legal Officer is, otherwise meaning, deferment is non action it will mean, the City Council has already missed to act within the fifteen days (working days March 5, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 22, 23, 24, 25, 2010) or (March 5-20, 2010) and therefore the appointment is confirmed by default.\r\n      The committee moved for the main issue, for confirmation of the appointment of Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsama subject to the result of the discussion on them issue. (CR NR. 00290-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-12-04', 'Referred to the Civil Service Commission (12 Apr 2010, 2b)', '-none-', NULL, 'There was already an opinion form the CSC regarding the appointment of Ms. Lacsamana', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2840, NULL, '03:40:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer', 'Letter dated 24 March 2010 of Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer, submitting the following relative to Resolution No. 053, s. 2010:\r\na.	investigation reports and related attachments regarding the City Hall robbery incident transpired last ', '-none-', '(NOTE:  Res. No. 053, s. 2010 requested the General Services Office (GSO) and the GMT Interlink Security Management Agency to submit a report on the City Hall robbery incident which occurred on 22 December 2009 and to apprise the Members of the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council) on the measures being undertaken to ensue the security of the building and its premises.)', 'furnished to the Hon. Members & Research Div. (attach as supp. doc. to Res. No. 053, s. 2010)', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
