(2844, NULL, '04:25:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Hon. City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr.', '1st Indorsement dated 17 March 2010 of then City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., returning the unsigned Resolution Numbered 007, series of 2010, entitled ?Recommending that the City Government of Baguio will hire a private/external auditor to audit the ci', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above resolution was forwarded to the Office of the City Mayor on 15 March 2010 and was returned unsigned to the Office of the City Secretary on 24 March 2010.) (Item 40, 26 April 2010 Agenda)', 'Committee on Laws', '2nd', '2010-06-04', '00474-10', 'A resolution is a format or written expression of opinion, sentiment, or intention. It is also the act of determining what action or course of action to be done. There are also non-binding resolutions, which are measures that do not become laws.\r\n       The City Mayor returned the above mentioned resolutions unsigned but with comments, which is neither an approval nor a veto. His intention is not known whether he agrees or disagrees with the City Council?s expression of opinions or sentiments.\r\n        Wherefore, considering that a resolution is an expression of a sentiment, opinion or intention, the Committee on Laws shall treat the unsigned city Council Resolutions effective for all legal intents and purposes. \r\n      Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez, Member of the Committee, signified ?For discussion en banc please?. (CR NR. 00474-10)', '0000-00-00', '2026-06-02', NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Laws for study and recommendation; Unfinished (28 Jun 2010, 61a)', '4th', '2010-07-07', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(2845, NULL, '09:45:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana, OIC, Department Head II, City Environment and Parks Management Office', '2nd Indorsement dated 24 March 2010 of Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana, OIC, Department Head II, City Environment and Parks Management Office, returning the request of Mr. Alvar to construct comfort rooms at Slaughterhouse with no cost to the city with the reit', '-none-', '(NOTE: The above matter is in reply to the 3rd Indorsement dated 17 March 2010 of the City Secretary forwarding to the City Environment and Parks Management Office and Health Services Office, for their comments and recommendation and thereafter submit to the City Council a written report three (3) days upon receipt hereof the letter dated 02 February 2010 of Mr. Ruperto V. Alvar, General Manager and Mr. Ruben Q. Pinlac, General Partner, R & R Management and Sanitary Services, seeking approval from the City Council to allow them to construct comfort rooms with no cost to the city at Slaughter Compound, per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons, approved during the 15 March 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons for information', '3rd', NULL, '00350-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be NOTED. (CR NR. 00350-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (17 May 2010, 52)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
