(2901, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Leandro B. YangotJr.', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 057-06 of then City Councilor Leandro B. Yangot Jr., and then City Councilor Leonardo Q. Bayan Jr., ?Institutionalizing the adolescent reproductive health program in the City of Baguio and appropriating funds for the purpose.?', 'Reproductive Health Program', '(NOTE: The letter dated 21 February 2006 of Dr. Florence G. Reyes, City Health Officer, Baguio wishing to refile and/or revive the final passage of the proposed ordinance ?institutionalizing the Adolescent Reproductive Program Health program in the City of Baguio and appropriating funds for the purpose? and the Proposed Ordinance of then Coun. Jonathan B. Tambol and Hon. Elmer O. Datuin were forwarded to the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection on 01 March 2006 and 09 July 2004, respectively.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '1st', NULL, '08-591', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection recommends that the above proposed ordinance be NOTED considering the recommendations of the attached letters of Mr. Jose S. Dacawi, Human Resource management Officer dated 15 August 2007 and the Division Chief of the Health services Office dated 08 August 2007 respectively', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED                         Proposal of Hon. Tambol and EOD included in the documents including letter of Dr. Reyes received on Feb 28, 2006 requesting for the immediate action on the matter.  The matter was attached to the letter of Dr. Reyes wishing to revive the PO  and forwarded to the Local Finance Committee', '5th', NULL, 'Acted Upon', 'LFC', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
