(3121, NULL, '10:00:00', '-none-', 'Barangay Resolution', 'Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay', 'Barangay Resolution No. 18, series of 2010, of Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay, entitled  ?A resolution adopting City Ordinance No. 07, Series of 2006, entitled; ?establishing barangay market day/s in all barangays of the City of Baguio?.?', '-none-', '-none-', 'Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce', '2nd', NULL, '00325-10', 'The Committee on Market, Trade and Commerce recommends that the herein barangay resolution of Honeymoon-Holyghost Barangay be NOTED and the appropriate words of appreciation be conveyed to the Barangay Council for adopting City Ordinance No. 07, series of 2006 and for taking the initial step in establishing market  in its locality. (CR NR. 00325-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'Forwarded to the Committee on Barangay Affairs for the committee to check on the compliance of Honeymoon-holyghost Barangay with Ordinance No. 07, series of 2006 [Establishing barangay market da/s in all barangays of the City of Baguio] (7 Jun 2010, 20)', '4th', '2010-10-06', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
