(3126, NULL, '04:10:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Ms. Gloria S. Evangelista, Administrative Officer V, OIC-Administrative Division', '1st Indorsement dated 30 March 2010 of Ms. Gloria S. Evangelista, Administrative Officer V, OIC-Administrative Division forwarding for information and appropriate action the letter dated 19 March 2010 of Mr. Luis M. Buenaflor, External Affairs Officer, An', '-none-', '(NOTE: The City Council has approved the following ordinances:\r\na) Ordinance Numbered 69, series of 1991 - An Ordinance amending Ordinance No. 104, series of 1949, regulating the business of dealing in dogs and the sales of meat thereof in the City of Baguio; and\r\nb) Ordinance No. 104, series of 1949 - An Ordinance regulating the business dealing in dogs, and the sale of meat thereof in the City of Baguio.)', 'Committee on Laws', '3rd', NULL, '0448-10', 'The Committee on Laws recommends that the above matter be NOTED considering that Ordinance Numbered 69, series of 1991 ?An ordinance amending Ordinance No. 104, series of 1949, regulating the business dealing in dogs and the sale of meat thereof in the City of Baguio? is still valid and existing. (CR NR. 0448-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 92)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
