(3128, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Dr. Florence G. Reyes, MD PMH MSc, City Health Officer', '1st Indorsement dated 31 March 2010 of Dr. Florence G. Reyes, MD PMH MSc, City Health Officer, transmitting for information and appropriate action the report dated 30 March 2010 of Engr. Candido S. Delos Santos, Engineer IV, Health Services Office, regard', '-none-', '(NOTE:  [a]  The letter dated 02 February 2010 of Mr. Ruperto V. Alvar, General Manager and Mr. Ruben Q. Pinlac, General Partner, R & R Management and Sanitary Services, seeking approval from the City Council to allow them to construct comfort rooms with no cost to the city at Slaughter Compound was forwarded to CEPMO and Health Services Office, for comments and recommendation and thereafter submit to the City Council a written report three (3) days upon receipt hereof, per recommendation of the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently Abled Persons, approved during the 15 March 2010 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod; and\r\n             [b]  The 2nd Indorsement dated 24 March 2010 of Ms. Cordelia C. Lacsamana, OIC, Department Head II, City Environment and Parks Management Office, returning the request of Mr. Alvar to construct comfort rooms at Slaughterhouse with no cost to the city with the reiteration that Slaughterhouse Compound is not within the jurisdiction of their office was forwarded to the Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently Abled Persons on 26 March 2010.)', 'Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons', '-none-', NULL, '00349-10', 'The Committee on Health and Sanitation, Ecology and Environmental Protection, Handicapped and Differently-Abled Persons recommends that the above be merely NOTED considering the attached letter of Engr. Candido S. Delos Santos, Engr. IV, of the Health Services Office which is self explanatory. (CR NR. 00349-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (17 May 2010, 51)', '-none-', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
