(3138, '2010-05-04', '03:30:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Julius John D. Marrero, President/CEO, Interlink Security Management Corp.', 'Letter dated 29 March 2010 of Mr. Julius John D. Marrero, President/CEO, Interlink Security Management Corp. to Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, submitting the following in compliance to Resolution No. 053, s. 2010, to wit:\r\na. Investigation report date', '-none-', '(NOTE: a.) The above matter is related to the letter dated 24 March 2010 of Mr. Romeo D. Concio, City General Services Officer, submitting the following relative to Resolution No. 053, s. 2010:\r\n                 a. investigation reports and related attachments regarding the City Hall robbery incident transpired last December 22, 2009; and\r\n                 b. copy of the proposed Security Management Plan of City Hall building and its vicinity. (copy furnished to the Hon. Members)\r\n        b.) Res. No. 053, s. 2010 requested the General Services Office (GSO) and the GMT Interlink Security Management Agency to submit a report on the City Hall robbery incident which occurred on 22 December 2009 and to apprise the Members of the Sangguniang Panlungsod (City Council) on the measures being undertaken to ensue the security of the building and its premises.)', 'Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order', '3rd', '2010-07-07', '00410-10', 'The Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel respectfully recommends filing or archiving the attached report of Mr. Julius D. Marrero, President/CEO, Interlink Security Management Corp., regarding investigation in compliance to City Council Resolution No. 053, Series of 2010. Hon. Fred L. Bagbagen, Member of the Committee signified \"Should not be archived but should be referred to the Committee on Peace and Order.\" (CR NR. 00410-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to the Committee on Human Rights, Justice, Public Protection and Safety, Peace and Order  (28 Jun 2010, 46)', '3rd', '2010-07-07', 'Pending; [Formerly indorsed and referred to the Committee on Ethics, Governmental Affairs and Personnel for information & furnished to the Hon. Members & Research Div. (attach as supp. doc. of Res. No. 053, s. 2010), 1st Ind, 07 Apr 2010]', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
