(3154, '2010-05-04', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Related motion', '-none-', 'Related motion on the request for the installation, rehabilitation and maintenance of streetlights along parks and barangays in the City of Baguio.', '-none-', '-none-', '-none-', '-none-', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-05-04', 'Forwarded to the Local Finance Committee thru Atty. Clemente, Chairperson, Baguio City, for the issuance of a certification of availability of funds for the following:\r\na. monthly electric consumption or an average of P100,000.00 a month for Burnham Park only, and said amount to be broken down as follows:\r\n     1. that the 124 newly installed lights would have a consumption of P29,195.00; and\r\n     2. the P70,000.00 will correspond to the rehabilitation of existing fixtures.\r\nb. amount of monthly consumption being paid for by the city for 25 parks and to determine if the city has the capacity or budget to pay the average monthly consumption of P32,962.00 per month.\r\nc. amount necessary for the installation of streetlights along barangay streets or roads. (5 Apr 2010, RM)', '1st', '2010-07-04', 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(3155, '2010-08-04', '08:50:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Local Finance Committee', '6th Indorsement dated 22 March 2010 of the Local Finance Committee, informing the City Secretary that the committee cannot certify to the availability of funds relative to the Proposed Ordinance No. 094-09 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, considering', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is in reply to the 5th Indorsement dated 11 March 2010 of the City Secretary forwarding to the Local Finance Committee thru Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, Chairperson, Baguio City, the Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 094-09 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as ?Identifying a part of the vacant lot in between the children?s playground and the city orchidarium as the site of the Mateo Cari?o  monument and providing funds therefor?, for the issuance of a certification of availability of funds.)', 'Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research for information', '7th', '2010-12-04', '00405-10', 'Considering the reply/information of the Local Finance Committee per its 6th Indorsement dated 22 March 2010 that it cannot certify to the availability of funds relative to the Proposed Ordinance Nr. 094-09 ?Identifying a part of the vacant lot in between the children?s playground and the city orchidarium as the site of the Mateo Cari?o  monument and providing funds therefor?; and\r\nTaking into account the suggestion of the Local Finance Committee for possible integration of the proposal in the ongoing preparation preparation of the master plan of Burnham Park by the University of the Cordilleras, the Committee on Education, Culture and Historical Research recommends that a copy of the  Proposed Ordinance Nr. 094-09 be sent to the University of the Cordilleras through Arch. Robert V. Romero for consideration.  In the meantime, while awaiting the completion of the Burnham Park master plan, let PO Nr. 094-09 be ARCHIVED in the records of the City Council.\r\nHon. Cosalan, a member of the committee, signified that: ?We recommend that this be converted into a resolution to simply identify the site for the purpose, w/o appropriating any fund.?(CR NR. 00405-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2010-07-06', 'a copy of the  Proposed Ordinance Nr. 094-09 be sent to the University of the Cordilleras through Arch. Robert V. Romero for consideration.  In the meantime, while awaiting the completion of the Burnham Park master plan, let PO Nr. 094-09 be ARCHIVED in the records of the City Council (7 Jun 2010, 90)', '9th', '2010-09-06', 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(3156, '2010-08-04', '08:50:00', '-none-', 'Indorsement', 'Local Finance Committee', '6th Indorsement dated 22 March 2010 of the Local Finance Committee, informing the City Secretary that the committee cannot favorably recommend the request relative to the Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 124-09 of Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez due to lack of funds', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is in reply to the 5th Indorsement dated 11 March 2010 of the City Secretary forwarding to the Local Finance Committee thru Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, Chairperson, Baguio City, the  Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 124-09 of Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez ?Creating the Tourism Recovery Plan, providing guidelines for the declaration of a state of tourism calamity, designating a governing body to implement and oversee the activation of the Tourism Recovery Plan and providing funds therefor?, for the issuance of a certification of availability of funds)', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds for information', '7th', '2010-12-04', '-none-', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, '-none-', '-none-', NULL, 'Related to PO 124-09 of Hon. Perlita L. Chan-Rondez', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
