(3187, '2010-12-04', '01:25:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Ms. Keidy Transfiguracion, Ms. Audrey Rose Corce, and Ms. Matyline Camfili, Kaigorotan Youth Week (KYW) Secretariat, Progressive Igorots for Social Action (PIGSA) Coordinator and Dap-ayan ti Kultura ti Kordilyera (DKK) Chairperson respectively', 'Letter dated 12 April 2010 of Ms. Keidy Transfiguracion, Ms. Audrey Rose Corce, and Ms. Matyline Camfili, Kaigorotan Youth Week (KYW) Secretariat, Progressive Igorots for Social Action (PIGSA) Coordinator and Dap-ayan ti Kultura ti Kordilyera (DKK) Chairp', '-none-', '(NOTE:  The above matter is related to the 4th Indorsement dated 16 February 2010 of Hon. Vice Mayor Daniel T. Fari?as, forwarding to Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, City Budget Officer,  the  letter dated 04 February 2010 of  Ms. Audrey Rose Corce, Ms. Matyline Camfili and Ms. Keidy Transfiguracion, Progressive Igorots for Social Action (PIGSA) Coordinator, Dap-ayan ti Kultura ti Kordilyera (DKK) Chairperson and Kaigorotan Youth Week (KYW) Secretariat respectively, seeking partnership and financial assistance from the city government for the conduct of  their activity, entitled ?Tawid ay Kaigorotan: Revitalization of Cordilleran Culture and Heritage for the Defense of Land, Life and Resources?,  for comment and recommendation.)', 'Committee on Ways and Means and Finance (Cluster A: Budget, Appropriations and Expenditures) for information', '1st', NULL, '00374-10', 'In view of the letter dated 14 April 2010 of Atty. Leticia O. Clemente, City Budget Officer, to herein proponent, which is hereto attached, informing them that the financial assistance being sought could not be granted in view of the provisions of Section 305 (b), of RA 7160 which states that ?Local government funds and monies shall be spent solely for public purposes?, the Committee on  Ways and Means and Finance, Cluster A, recommends that the foregoing matter be NOTED. (CR NR. 00374-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'NOTED (21 Jun 2010, 50b)', '6th', NULL, 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
