(3798, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Pablo L. Palangdao, Building II, Maharlika Livelihood Center', 'Letter dated 22 November 2006 of Mr. Pablo L. Palangdao, requesting the intervention of the Honorable Body for proper investigation regarding the issuance of Administrative Order No. 130, s. 2006 and the proper recommendations on the conflict between the ', 'Maharlika Closure', '(NOTE: a.  The Motion for Reconsideration dated 16 November 2006 filed by Mr. Pablo L. Palangdao to Hon. Acting City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr., seeking reconsideration of Administrative Order No. 130, series of 2006 was furnished to the Honorable Members of the City Council on 17 November 2006.\nb. Administrative Order No. 130, series of 2006, issued by Hon. Acting City Mayor Reinaldo A. Bautista Jr. is for the revocation of business permit issued to various establishments operating within the Palangdao Building, Maharlika Livelihood Center.)\n  c. Res. Nr. 263, s. 2005 approved the recommendation of the Committee on Laws as contained in its 3rd Indorsement dated 15 September 2005 to declare that the provisions of City Ordinance Numbered 51, series of 2001, otherwise known as the Comprehensive Zoning Ordinance for the City of Baguio, prevail over the  general provisions of Section 134, Paragraph 4, and Section 139 of City Tax Ordinance Numbered 2000-001 and the further recommendation to uphold the request of Mr. Pablo L. Palangdao to the Office of the City Mayor for reclassification of their business permit for ?Restaurant? to ?Restaurant with Bar?.)', 'Committee on Laws', '1st', NULL, '07-137', '-none-', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Back to Committee (26 Feb 2007, 31)', '3rd', NULL, '-none-', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
(3799, NULL, '00:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Faustino A. Olowan', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 168-06 of then City Councilor Faustino A. Olowan ?Appropriating an amount of One Million Pesos (P1,000,000.00) from the city fund for the conduct of final land survey of Proclamation 7-2001 covering barangays Middle Quezon Hill, ', '168-06', '-none-', 'Committee on Urban Planning, Lands and Housing', '1st', NULL, '0213-11', 'With the implementation of the Townsite Survey CAR-Baguio City for Final Lot Survey and Adjustment of Old Surveys Project by the Department of Environment and Natural Resources-CAR, the Committee on  Urban Planning, Lands and Housing recommends that the above matter BE NOTED. (CR NR. 0213-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, '2011-04-04', 'NOTED - returned to former Councilor Faustino A. Olowan, Lucnab Barangay, Baguio City.\r\nDuring the 04 April 2011 Regular Session of the Sangguniang Panlungsod ng Baguio, the above matter was noted for being moot and academic with the implementation of the Townsite Survey CAR - Baguio City for Finacial Lot Survey and Adjustment of Old Surveys Project by the Department of Environment and Natural Resources-CAR (04 Apr 2011, 66)', '3rd', '2011-06-04', 'Acted upon', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
