(4701, '2007-05-07', '12:00:00', '-none-', 'PO', 'Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda', 'Proposed Ordinance Nr. PO 055-07 of Hon. Betty Lourdes F. Tabanda ?Establishing a Micro Finance Fund and providing the guidelines for availment thereof.?', '055-07', '-none-', 'Committee on Social Services, Women and Urban Poor', '1st', '2007-10-07', '00102-10', 'The above-cited proposal have been forwarded to the Local Finance Committee for the issuance of a Certification of Availability of Funds (CAF). To the present, no response has been received by the committee.\r\nThe Committee on Social Services, Women, and Urban Poor recommends that pending the issuance of the CAF by the Local Finance Committee, the above matter be forwarded to the concerned department for possible inclusion in their regular activities, to be funded under their respective department budget. (CR NR. 00102-10)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Forwarded to OCSWDO through Ms. Betty F. Fangasan, Baguio City, for possible inclusion in their regular activities, to be funded under their respective department\'s budget, pending the issuance of the CAF by the Local Finance Committee (22 Feb 2010, 137)', '4th', NULL, 'Pending', 'BFT 2007', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
