(4703, '2007-05-07', '00:00:00', '-none-', 'Letter', 'Mr. Tereso O. Panga, Zone Administrator, Philippine Economic Zone Authority', 'Letter dated 04 July 2007 of Mr. Tereso O. Panga, Zone Administrator, Philippine Economic Zone Authority, soliciting support of the City Council by endorsing the application of Baguio Country Club to develop and operate a retirement park/center called ?Ba', '?Baguio Country Club Retirement Economic Zone?.', '-none-', 'Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds', '1st', '2007-09-07', '0481-11', 'Attached hereto is an endorsement from Engr. Evelyn B. Cayat, OIC-City Planning and Development Coordinator, informing this committee that the development projects as stated by General Manager Anthony De Leon of the Baguio Country Club to be undertaken within their premises for a retirement/ecozone center are allowed.\r\n              In view of the foregoing, the Committee on Tourism, Special Events, Parks and Playgrounds recommends to endorse the application of Baguio Country Club to develop and operate a retirement park/center within their premises. (CR NR. 0481-11)', '0000-00-00', NULL, NULL, 'Deferred - returned to committee for further study and to forward the matter to the Local Finance Committee for the preparation of the financial aspect particularly the effect on the city of the said proposal; Letter dated 28 Oct 2011 was sent to Engr. Cayat requesting to provide guidelines as basis of considering requests/applications on development and operation of retirement parks/centers (24 Oct 2011, 5); Unfinished (10 Oct 2011, 6); Invite Engr. Cayat, OIC, City Planning and Development Office, on 17 October 2011 RS (26 Sep 2011, 16)', '5th', NULL, 'Pending', '-none-', '2026-06-03 06:33:43'),
